msgid "Nursing Assistant"
msgstr "Auxiliar de enfermería"

#. ~ Profession (male Nursing Assistant) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were providing in-home care for the elderly, even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Estabas brindando atención en el hogar a personas mayores, incluso mientras "
"el mundo se desmoronaba a tu alrededor.  Solo puedes rezar para no ver a tus"
" antiguos clientes entre los muertos vivientes..."

