msgid "Bow Hunter"
msgstr "Arquera Cazadora"

#. ~ Profession (male Bow Hunter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and you soon took a liking to"
" the challenge of hunting with a bow.  Why, if the world ended there's "
"nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty bow.  So when it did, "
"you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Desde que eras niño te encantaba cazar, e inmediatamente te interesó el "
"desafío de cazar con un arco. Por eso, si el mundo termina no hay otra cosa "
"que quieras más tener contigo que tu fiel arco. Así que cuando sucedió, te "
"aseguraste de tenerlo encima."

