msgid "Bionic Runner"
msgstr "Corredora biónica"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Runner) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were that kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body to do it even better.  Now there is "
"plenty to run from, but this is your kind of game."
msgstr ""
"Eras ese tipo de deportista que no podía salirse de la pista. Te encanta "
"correr y mejoraste tu cuerpo para hacerlo aún mejor. Ahora hay mucho de qué "
"correr, pero este es tu tipo de juego."

