#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Commercial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Comercial"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Commercial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Comercial"

#. ~ Profession (male Commercial Cyborg) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?  Only time "
"will tell if your passion for electronics and your status as a marvel of "
"bionic technology will be enough to ensure your survival after the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tenías que tener los mejores y más recientes artilugios y gadgets, "
"así que no es de extrañar que hayas mejorado tu cuerpo junto con tu teléfono"
" inteligente. Solo el tiempo dirá si tu pasión por la electrónica y tu "
"estatus como maravilla de la tecnología biónica serán suficientes para "
"garantizar tu supervivencia después del apocalipsis."

#. ~ Profession (female Commercial Cyborg) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?  Only time "
"will tell if your passion for electronics and your status as a marvel of "
"bionic technology will be enough to ensure your survival after the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
