#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombera"

#. ~ Profession (male Firefighter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a first responder you were direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors of"
" the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit while "
"on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more than "
"your trusty iron and bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
"Como socorrista fuiste testigo directo de los horrores desgarradores del "
"apocalipsis. Separado de la mayoría de tu equipo y tu unidad mientras "
"estabas de guardia, te viste obligado a luchar para llegar a un lugar seguro"
" con poco más que tu fiel armadura y tu equipo ignífugo."

#. ~ Profession (female Firefighter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
