#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Razor Boy"
msgstr "Mercenario Biónico"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Razor Girl"
msgstr "Mercenaria Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (male Razor Boy) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
"  Now that the world has ended, those bionic enhancements may spell the "
"difference between life and death."
msgstr ""
"A través de una serie de cirugías caras y dolorosas, te convertiste en un "
"arma biónica ambulante. Tus servicios como mercenario estaban disponibles al"
" mejor postor. Ahora que el mundo se terminó, esas mejoras biónicas pueden "
"ser la diferencia entre la vida y la muerte."

#. ~ Profession (female Razor Girl) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
"  Now that the world has ended, those bionic enhancements may spell the "
"difference between life and death."
msgstr ""
