"podrás dar alrededor de los muertos vivientes hasta que puedan bloquearte?"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Farmer"
msgstr "Granjero"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Farmer"
msgstr "Granjera"

#. ~ Profession (male Farmer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were making a living by raising crops, when the Cataclysm struck.  Now, "
"with your trusty hoe and some seeds it's time to rebuild the Earth, one "
"plant at a time."
msgstr ""
"Te estabas ganando la vida cultivando, cuando llegó el Cataclismo. Ahora, "
"con tu querida azada y algunas semillas, es hora de reconstruir la Tierra, "
"una planta a la vez."

#. ~ Profession (female Farmer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
