#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivalist Jr."
msgstr "Superviviente Junior"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Survivalist Jr."
msgstr "Superviviente Junior"

#. ~ Profession (male Survivalist Jr.) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You "
"didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now "
"is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"Tus padres eran preparadores locos que pensaban que se acercaba un "
"\"Cataclismo\" e insistieron en prepararte para ello. Resulta que estaban en"
" lo correcto. No tuviste la oportunidad de agradecérselo. Lo único que "
"puedes hacer por ellos ahora es lo que siempre esperaron que hicieras en los"
" días oscuros que se avecinan: sobrevivir."

#. ~ Profession (female Survivalist Jr.) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were crazy preppers who thought some \"Cataclysm\" was coming, "
"and insisted on preparing you for it.  Turns out they were right.  You "
"didn't get a chance to thank them.  The only thing you can do for them now "
"is what they always hoped you would do in the dark days ahead: survive."
msgstr ""
"Tus padres eran preparadores locos que pensaban que se acercaba un "
"\"Cataclismo\" e insistieron en prepararte para ello. Resulta que estaban en"
