msgid "Dodgeball Player"
msgstr "Jugadora de Matanza"

#. ~ Profession (male Dodgeball Player) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked to play dodgeball, where failing to dodge the ball meant you were "
"out.  Now failing to dodge threatens your life.  Don't slip up."
msgstr ""
"Te gustaba jugar a la matanza, donde no poder esquivar la pelota significaba"
" que te quedabas afuera del juego. Ahora, \"matanza\" tiene otro "
"significado, y no poder esquivar es una amenaza para tu vida. No la cagues."

