#. ~ Description for electric well pump
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-plumbing.json
msgid "An electric well pump connected to a fluid grid.  It has no power."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-plumbing.json
