msgstr "arcilla"

#. ~ Description for clay
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A field full of malleable clay, suitable for kiln firing if it was extracted"
" properly.  Dig a shallow pit here to harvest the clay."
msgstr ""
"Un campo lleno de arcilla maleable, adecuada para ser cocida en un horno si "
"se extrae correctamente.  Cava un pozo poco profundo aquí para cosechar la "
"arcilla."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
