msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño arbusto de arándanos agrios, a menudo confundidos con las "
"moras azules."

#. ~ Description for huckleberry bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small huckleberry bush that's fruitless."
msgstr "Es un pequeño arbusto de arándanos agrios sin frutos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "raspberry bush"
msgstr "arbusto de frambuesas"

#. ~ Description for raspberry bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small bush of delicious raspberries.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño arbusto de deliciosas frambuesas. Ten cuidado con las espinas."

#. ~ Description for raspberry bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small raspberry bush that's fruitless.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño arbusto de frambuesas sin frutos. Tené cuidado con las "
"espinas."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "grape bush"
msgstr "arbusto de uvas"

#. ~ Description for grape bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A bush of a different species invaded by vines of grapes."
msgstr "Es un arbusto de diferente especie invadido por la vid de la uva."

#. ~ Description for grape bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A bush of a different species invaded by grape vines but they're fruitless."
msgstr ""
"Es un arbusto de diferente especie invadido por la vid de la uva pero sin "
"frutos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "rose bush"
msgstr "arbusto de rosas"

#. ~ Description for rose bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A fat bush of beautiful red roses, if only you could get a date!  Watch out "
"for its thorns!"
msgstr ""
"Es un arbusto gordo de hermosas rosas rojas, ¡si pudieras tener pareja! "
"Cuidado con las espinas."

#. ~ Description for rose bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A fat rose bush that currently has no blooms.  Watch out for its thorns!"
msgstr ""
"Es un arbusto gordo de rosas sin flores. Tené cuidado con las espinas."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "hydrangea bush"
msgstr "arbusto de hortensia"

#. ~ Description for hydrangea bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A fat, bush of fragrant blue hydrangeas."
msgstr "Es un arbusto gordo de aromáticas hortensias azules."

#. ~ Description for hydrangea bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A fat hydrangea bush that currently has no blooms."
msgstr "Es un arbusto gordo de hortensias pero sin flores."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "lilac bush"
msgstr "arbusto de lilas"

#. ~ Description for lilac bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A wide, bush of bright pinkish purple lilacs."
msgstr "Es un arbusto ancho con brillantes lílas púrpuras y rosadas."

#. ~ Description for lilac bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A wide lilac bush that currently has no blooms."
msgstr "Es un arbusto ancho de lilas pero sin flores."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tree trunk"
msgstr "tocón"

#. ~ Description for tree trunk
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A section of trunk from a tree that has been cut down.  Can be sawn into "
"logs with the right tool."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "sunken tree trunk"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for sunken tree trunk
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A section of trunk from a tree that has fallen from the shallows above and "
"ended up down here at some point. It's waterlogged and seems to be partially"
" eaten by worms."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "glub."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tree stump"
msgstr "tocón"

#. ~ Description for tree stump
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A tree stump, remnant of a tree that has been cut down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "woodchips"
msgstr "astillas de madera"

#. ~ Description for woodchips
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"Small splinters of wood laid out in a layer to prevent unwanted plants from "
"growing."
msgstr ""
"Son pequeñas astillas de madera tiradas formando una capa para evitar que "
"crezcan plantas no deseadas."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "grass"
msgid_plural "grasses"
msgstr[0] "pasto"
msgstr[1] "pastos"
msgstr[2] "pastos"

#. ~ Description for grass
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"An area of hardy Kentucky bluegrass about ankle high.  Cutting the grass "
"short enough would destroy the root system, causing this area to turn into a"
" patch of dirt."
msgstr ""
"Es un área de pasto azul de Kentucky, que te llega a los tobillos. Si cortás"
" el pasto bien corto vas a destruir el sistema de raíces, causando que este "
"lugar se transforme en un pedazo de tierra."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "white grass"
msgstr "cesped blanco"

#. ~ Description for white grass
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A section of Kentucky bluegrass covered in white latex-based paint, with "
"neat lines designed for recreational sports."
msgstr ""
"Una sección de césped azul de Kentucky cubierta de pintura a base de látex "
"blanco, con líneas limpias diseñadas para deportes recreativos."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "long grass"
msgstr "hierba crecida"

#. ~ Description for long grass
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long shaggy grass about shin high."
msgstr "Hierba larga y peluda que te llega sobre la espinilla."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "tall grass"
msgstr "hierba alta"

#. ~ Description for tall grass
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Tall grass about head high."
msgstr "Hierba alta que te llega sobre la cabeza."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "dead grass"
msgstr "hierba muerta"

#. ~ Description for dead grass
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Long shaggy grass that hasn't been cut recently."
msgstr "Es pasto largo y desprolijo que hace rato que no lo cortan."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "golf green"
msgstr "green"

#. ~ Description for golf green
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "Grass mowed very short and neat."
msgstr ""
"Es pasto cortado muy cortito y prolijo, el que se ve en el green de las "
"canchas de golf."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "golf hole"
msgstr "hoyo de golf"

#. ~ Description for golf hole
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A small plastic cup embedded in the grass."
msgstr "Es un pequeño vaso de plástico metido en el pasto."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "fern"
msgstr "helecho"

#. ~ Description for fern
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A short plant with thousands of leaves which grow in a fractal pattern from "
"the stem."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for fern
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A short plant with thousands leaves which grow in a fractal pattern, without"
" any curled shoots."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "cacao tree"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for cacao tree
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A thick tree belonging to the 'Theobroma' genus, native to Central and South"
" America, that has been genetically engineered to withstand New England's "
"four seasons.  If you examined the trunk of the tree, you could probably "
"find some mature cacao pods.  Even in the face of apocalypse, you can't give"
" up chocolate, of course.  You could cut it down with the right tools."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for cacao tree
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A thick tree belonging to the 'Theobroma' genus, native to Central and South"
" America, that has been genetically engineered to withstand New England's "
"four seasons.  Looks like all the ripe cacao pods have been picked.  You "
"could cut it down with the right tools."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "coca plant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for coca plant
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tree native to South America, coca leaves have been used as medicine, "
"tonic, and tea for thousands of years.  It was modified to withstand New "
"England weather for medical research, only to be accidentally introduced to "
"the wild.  If you examined the trunk of the tree, you could probably find "
"some mature coca leaves."
msgstr ""
"Un árbol nativo de Sudamérica, las hojas de coca han sido utilizadas como "
"medicina, tónico y té durante miles de años.  Se modificó para resistir el "
"clima de Nueva Inglaterra para investigaciones médicas, solo para ser "
"introducido accidentalmente en la naturaleza.  Si examinaras el tronco del "
"árbol, probablemente podrías encontrar algunas hojas de coca maduras."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "harvested coca plant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for harvested coca plant
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tree native to South America, coca leaves have been used as medicine, "
"tonic, and tea for thousands of years.  Looks like all the coca leaves have "
"been picked."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "marloss bush"
msgstr "arbusto de marloss"

#. ~ Description for marloss bush
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This alien plant superficially resembles a blueberry bush, and hangs with "
"large, juicy pink pomes that emit a heady, fruity aroma."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-triffid.json
msgid "poof!"
msgstr "¡puf!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal bed"
msgstr "cama fúngica"

#. ~ Description for fungal bed
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Fungus grows thick here, obscuring the ground beneath it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal floor"
msgstr "suelo fúngico"

#. ~ Description for fungal floor
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Grayish mold coats both the floor and the roof here, silent and still.  "
"Stray spores waft through the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for fungal floor
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the floor here, silent and still."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for fungal floor
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "Grayish mold coats the ground here, silent and still."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/json/monsters/fungus.json data/mods/Limit Fungal Growth/modinfo.json
msgid "fungal wall"
msgid_plural "fungal walls"
msgstr[0] "pared fúngica"
msgstr[1] "paredes fúngicas"
msgstr[2] "paredes fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal wall
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Several thick, large tendrils of fungus perforate the wall here, piercing "
"straight through it from the outside.  Despite the apparent damage, the wall"
" is still structurally sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for fungal wall
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"The fungus here has grown thickly and tightly enough to form a solid wall.  "
"It feels very stiff to the touch, and seems to be very strong."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal mound"
msgstr "montículo fúngico"

#. ~ Description for fungal mound
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "A mound of fungal matter, intertwined in itself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal shrub"
msgstr "maleza fúngica"

#. ~ Description for fungal shrub
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This shrub has been completely absorbed by the mushrooms.  Its branches "
"droop and have lost much of their structure, and its leaves have vanished, "
"replaced by fleshy gray sacks that visibly expand and contract."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "fungal tree"
msgstr "árbol fúngico"

#. ~ Description for fungal tree
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"Once tall and majestic, this tree is now a slave to the fungus like the "
"landscape around it.  Its bark is penetrated by and covered with fungal "
"tendrils, and the canopy has rotted away, leaving only the branches, "
"stretching forlornly to the sky as if to escape the infection overrunning "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "young fungal tree"
msgstr "árbol joven fúngico"

#. ~ Description for young fungal tree
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid "A small sapling poking through the ground, infested by fungal mold."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/terrain.json
msgid "marloss tree"
msgstr "árbol de marloss"

#. ~ Description for marloss tree
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-fungal.json
msgid ""
"This tree stands as a stark outlier to the landscape around it.  Despite its"
" infestation, its leaves wave proudly in the wind, colored pinkish-white.  "
"Its branches are heavy with pink fruit that looks both mutated and "
"delicious."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "shallow water"
msgstr "agua poco profunda"

#. ~ Description for shallow water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "deep water"
msgstr "agua profunda"

#. ~ Description for deep water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You're having trouble seeing the bottom through the deep water here.  With a"
" watertight container, you could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "murky shallow water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for murky shallow water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here but is murky with organic matter.  With a "
"watertight container, you could gather fetid water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for murky shallow water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here but it is murky with organic matter.  With a "
"watertight container, you could gather fetid water from here.  Not safe to "
"drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "flowing shallow water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for flowing shallow water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The streaming water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you "
"could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is, although "
"probably safer than stagnant water."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "flowing deep water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for flowing deep water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The streaming water looks deep here.  With a watertight container, you could"
" gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is, although probably "
"safer than stagnant water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for shallow water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The water isn't too deep here.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather salt water from here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for deep water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You're having trouble seeing the bottom through the deep water here.  With a"
" watertight container, you could gather salt water from here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "pool water"
msgstr "charco de agua"

#. ~ Description for pool water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"A deep pool full of water.  Never swim without a lifeguard present.  Even "
"though monsters probably ate them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "shallow pool water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for shallow pool water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "A shallow pool of water."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "sewage"
msgstr "agua cloacal"

#. ~ Description for sewage
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"Gross.  Sewage water flows through here.  As if it needed saying, this isn't"
" safe to drink."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for lava
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"An extremely hot, glowing liquid, composed of molten rock and/or metal.  In "
"some places, lava-grilled steak is a delicacy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "submersed water"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for submersed water
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are submerged below the surface of the water, your feet can't touch the "
"ground.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh water from "
"here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "lake bed"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for lake bed
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water.  With a watertight "
"container, you could gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "water moss"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for water moss
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "Moist spongy water moss."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "ocean bed"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for ocean bed
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of salt water.  With a watertight "
"container, you could gather salt water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "bulkhead"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for bulkhead
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The top of a submerged structure.  With a watertight container, you could "
"gather fresh water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for bulkhead
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"The interior of a submerged structure.  At least this part hasn't flooded "
"yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid "underwater bulkhead"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for underwater bulkhead
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "The interior of a submerged structure.  This part has been flooded."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "submerged concrete"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for submerged concrete
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water on a pad of "
"concrete.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh water from "
"here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for submerged concrete
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"You are standing at the bottom of a body of fresh water on a pad of concrete"
" with yelllow paint.  With a watertight container, you could gather fresh "
"water from here.  Not safe to drink as is."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "gasoline pump"
msgstr "surtidor de gasolina"

#. ~ Description for gasoline pump
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Precious GASOLINE.  The former world bowed to their petroleum god as it led "
"them to their ruin.  There's plenty left over to fuel your inner road "
"warrior.  If this gas dispenser doesn't give up the goods for free, you may "
"have to pay at a nearby terminal."
msgstr ""
"Preciosa GASOLINA. El antiguo mundo se inclinó ante su dios del petróleo "
"mientras los conducía a la ruina.  Aún queda suficiente para alimentar a tu "
"guerrero de la carretera interior.  Si este dispensador de gasolina no "
"ofrece el producto de forma gratuita, es posible que debas pagar en una "
"terminal cercana."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
