msgid_plural "Cable Charger System CBM Mk. IIs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid_plural "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Filamento de carbono subdérmico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Filamento de carbono subdérmico"
msgstr[2] "MCB Filamento de carbono subdérmico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  "
"This reduces all bashing damage by 5%, cutting damage by 10%, and ballistic "
"damage by 15%."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightning CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Rayos en cadena"
msgstr[1] "MCB Rayos en cadena"
msgstr[2] "MCB Rayos en cadena"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chain Lightning CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A chain lightning generator that emits a blast of lightning at a target, "
"leaving a trail of lightning in its wake and jumping to additional targets "
"within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr ""
"Es un generador de rayos en cadena que emite un rayo hacia el objetivo, "
"dejando una estela y saltando hacia otros objetivos en un área de 4 "
"espacios."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Claws CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Garras biónicas"
msgstr[1] "MCB Garras biónicas"
msgstr[2] "MCB Garras biónicas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Claws CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Vicious, retractable claws that are implanted inside the user's fingers.  "
"These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent the user from holding "
"anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Son unas garras feroces y retráctiles instaladas dentro de los dedos del "
"usuario. Hacen un daño cortante considerable, pero no te permiten agarrar "
"nada cuando están extendidas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Climate Control CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Control interno de temperatura"
msgstr[1] "MCB Control interno de temperatura"
msgstr[2] "MCB Control interno de temperatura"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Climate Control CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient "
"temperatures once activated."
msgstr ""
"Es una red de canales térmicos que cuando se activan, reducen los efectos de"
" la temperatura ambiente, sea baja o alta."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cloaking System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de ocultamiento"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de ocultamiento"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de ocultamiento"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cloaking System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user blend"
" into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and optical"
" sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means such as "
"infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema de gran potencia utiliza un conjunto de cámaras y LEDs para "
"hacer que el usuario se camufle en el ambiente, haciéndolo totalmente "
"invisible a los ojos y sensores ópticos. De todas maneras, no evita la "
"detección mediante otras maneras como sonares, infrarrojos, etcétera."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid_plural "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Pelea en espacios cerrados"
msgstr[1] "MCB Pelea en espacios cerrados"
msgstr[2] "MCB Pelea en espacios cerrados"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Close Quarters Battle CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat "
"programs.  Whilst active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-"
"hand combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de procesadores biónicos y bases de datos cargadas con "
"programas de combate y artes marciales. Cuando está activo, el módulo de "
"Pelea en Espacios Cerrados mejorará la habilidad en combate cuerpo a cuerpo,"
" pero impide ganar experiencia en las peleas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Reflejos conectados"
msgstr[1] "MCB Reflejos conectados"
msgstr[2] "MCB Reflejos conectados"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wired Reflexes CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, granting a +2 "
"bonus to dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Son unos estimuladores biónicos de nervios que mejoran mucho el tiempo de "
"reacción, lo que otorga un bonus de +2 a la destreza."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid_plural "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema digestivo expandido"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema digestivo expandido"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema digestivo expandido"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Expanded Digestive System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module contains three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only will these extract much more nutrition from food, but "
"also make the user immune to foodborne illness, parasites, and even allow "
"the digestion of rotten food."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Audición mejorada"
msgstr[1] "MCB Audición mejorada"
msgstr[2] "MCB Audición mejorada"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Enhanced Hearing CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically "
"improved, allowing them to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage their hearing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esté biónico está activado, mejorará la audición drásticamente, lo "
"que permite escuchar diez veces mejor que lo normal. Además, los sonidos de "
"alta intensidad serán automáticamente disminuidos antes de que puedan dañar "
"la audición."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "EMP Projector CBM"
msgid_plural "EMP Projector CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Proyector PEM"
msgstr[1] "MCB Proyector PEM"
msgstr[2] "MCB Proyector PEM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'EMP Projector CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and "
"hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to "
"aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Es un sistema generador PEM implantado en la mano y brazo derecho del "
"usuario. El sistema dispara pulsos precisos que requieren tiempo para "
"apuntar. Es extremadamente efectivo contra objetivos electrónicos pero casi "
"inútil para los demás casos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid_plural "Ethanol Burner CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Quemador de etanol"
msgstr[1] "MCB Quemador de etanol"
msgstr[2] "MCB Quemador de etanol"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ethanol Burner CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A reactor that burns alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  It"
" can store up to 500ml and accepts ethanol, methanol and denatured alcohol "
"as fuel."
msgstr ""
"Es un reactor que quema alcohol para ser usado como combustible de una "
"manera extremadamente eficiente. Puede contener hasta 500ml y acepta como "
"combustible etanol, metanol y alcohol desnaturalizado."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid_plural "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Aero-evaporador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Aero-evaporadores"
msgstr[2] "MCB Aero-evaporadores"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid_plural "Diamond Cornea CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Córnea de Diamante"
msgstr[1] "MCBs Córnea de Diamante"
msgstr[2] "MCBs Córnea de Diamante"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Diamond Cornea CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of diamond corneas which greatly enhance the user's vision, granting a"
" +2 bonus to perception."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de córneas de diamante que incrementan mucho la visión del "
"usuario, otorgando un bonus de +2 a la percepción."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Telescopic Lenses CBM"
msgid_plural "Telescopic Lenses CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Lentes Telescópicas"
msgstr[1] "MCBs Lentes Telescópicas"
msgstr[2] "MCBs Lentes Telescópicas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Telescopic Lenses CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses that replaces your natural "
"lenses.  This fixes any mundane vision problems and allows for an increased "
"vision range akin to binoculars.  Once installed they will be impossible to "
"remove, having replaced part of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de lentes de alta potencia y autoenfoque que reemplaza tus "
"cristalinos naturales. Esto soluciona cualquier problema de visión mundano y"
" permite un rango de visión aumentado similar al de unos binoculares. Una "
"vez instalados, serán imposibles de remover, ya que habrán reemplazado parte"
" de tus ojos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Facial Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Distorsión facial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Distorsión facial"
msgstr[2] "MCB Distorsión facial"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial Distortion CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, this bionic "
"module lets the user alter their facial structure so as to subtly affect the"
" reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr ""
"A través de la aplicación controlada de impulsos electromecánicos, este "
"biónico permite al usuario alterar su estructura facial para afectar "
"sutilmente las reacciones de los demás. Esto otorga un bonus a todas las "
"interacciones sociales."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid_plural "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de capacitancia dieléctrica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de capacitancia dieléctrica"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de capacitancia dieléctrica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dielectric Capacitance System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the "
"body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"Es una red de minicapacitores piezoeléctricos implantados en todo el cuerpo,"
" para protegerlo de las descargas eléctricas externas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerhack CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-hackeador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-hackeador"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dedo-hackeador"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingerhack CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the right hand."
"  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and "
"the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a "
"failed use may cause damage."
msgstr ""
"Es un electrohackeador miniatura, quirúrgicamente incorporado en un dedo de "
"la mano derecha. Es una unidad de hackeo útil para anular paneles de control"
" y cosas similares, pero no computadoras. Tu habilidad en computadoras es "
"importante y un uso fallido puede causar daño."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Flashbang Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador de destellos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador de destellos"
msgstr[2] "MCB Generador de destellos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flashbang Generator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable "
"to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr ""
"Es una combinación de LEDs y parlantes que crean un flash y sonido "
"comparables a una granada de destello, ensordeciendo y encegueciendo a los "
"enemigos cercanos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid_plural "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Linterna craneal"
msgstr[1] "MCB Linterna craneal"
msgstr[2] "MCB Linterna craneal"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cranial Flashlight CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the eyes."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña pero poderosa linterna LED que va montada entre los ojos."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'LED Tattoo'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An LED display implanted beneath the epidermis that can display patterns or "
"pictures through the skin.  When active it glows dimly, providing a very "
"small amount of light."
msgstr ""
"Es una pantalla LED implantada debajo de la epidermis que puede exhibir "
"dibujos o patrones en la piel. Cuando está activado, brilla levemente, "
"brindando una pequeña cantidad de luz."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dosímetro integrado"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dosímetro integrado"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dosímetro integrado"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Dosimeter CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the"
" user to analyze their level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert "
"the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr ""
"Son unos pequeños sensores de radiación instalados en el cuerpo, que "
"permiten al usuario analizar el nivel de radiación absorbida. También sirven"
" para alertar cuando el usuario está expuesto a la radiación ambiental."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Respirator CBM"
msgid_plural "Respirator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Respirador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Respirador"
msgstr[2] "MCB Respirador"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Respirator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system that increases the user's maximal "
"oxygen uptake and allows for underwater breathing akin to gills.  Will "
"automatically activate if the user is drowning."
msgstr ""
"Es un complejo sistema de mejora de la respiración que le permite al usuario"
" una absorción máxima de oxígeno, y permite la respiración debajo del agua "
"similar a las branquias. Se activará automáticamente cuando el usuario se "
"está ahogando."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid_plural "Terranian Sonar CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sonar terrestre"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sonar terrestre"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sonar terrestre"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Terranian Sonar CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Precision sonar equipment, implanted in the feet to allow the detection of "
"below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Es equipo sonar de precisión, implantado en los pies para permitir la "
"detección de movimiento debajo de la tierra, trampas enterradas y terreno "
"inestable."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Heat Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Drenaje de calor"
msgstr[1] "MCB Drenaje de calor"
msgstr[2] "MCB Drenaje de calor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Heat Drain CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"Cuando peleás desarmado contra un oponente de sangre caliente, hay una "
"posibilidad de que un golpe drene calor corporal, causando un poco de daño "
"adicional y recargando levemente las reservas de energía del usuario."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Disipación térmica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Disipación térmica"
msgstr[2] "MCB Disipación térmica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thermal Dissipation CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are woven into the user's flesh.  "
"While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 "
"degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Supermateriales y disipadores poderosos de calor han sido entretejidos en la"
" carne del usuario. Cuando está encendido, este sistema previene daños por "
"calor externo de hasta un poco más de 1000 Cº. Acordate que esto no afecta "
"la temperatura corporal interna."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Musculatura hidráulica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Musculatura hidráulica"
msgstr[2] "MCB Musculatura hidráulica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hydraulic Muscles CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases strength by "
"20."
msgstr ""
"Es un sistema hidráulico de soporte muscular que cuando está activado, "
"incrementa la fuerza en 20 puntos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Infolink CBM"
msgid_plural "Infolink CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infolink CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm this was a state-of-the-art communications package.  "
"Even without cell service, it can still double as a two-way radio if "
"installed.  Also comes with an internal chronometer with silent alarm clock "
"feature, an air temperature sensor, and more detailed weather readouts when "
"activated."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Infrared Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Visión infrarroja"
msgstr[1] "MCB Visión infrarroja"
msgstr[2] "MCB Visión infrarroja"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infrared Vision CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module that extends the range of vision into the infrared, allowing"
" the user to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr ""
"Es un biónico que extiende hasta los infrarojos el rango de visión, "
"permitiendo al usuario ver criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad y a "
"través del humo."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Cerebral Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Estimulador cerebral"
msgstr[1] "MCB Estimulador cerebral"
msgstr[2] "MCB Estimulador cerebral"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cerebral Booster CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the brain, granting a +2 bonus to "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Hay unos coprocesadores biónicos implantados en el cerebro, lo que otorga un"
" bonus de +2 a la inteligencia."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-Láser"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-Láser"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dedo-Láser"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Finger-Mounted Laser CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the fingertip.  This long "
"range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has the "
"potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño laser de gran poder incorporado en la punta de los dedos. Esta"
" arma de largo alcance no hace un daño muy grande, pero es muy precisa y "
"puede encender fuego."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid_plural "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema cultivador de leucocitos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema cultivador de leucocitos"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema cultivador de leucocitos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leukocyte Breeder System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, allowing "
"them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  It is "
"designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when "
"turned off."
msgstr ""
"Son unos estimuladores biónicos que aumentan el sistema de hematopoyesis del"
" usuario, que permite acelerar la producción de glóbulos blancos, utilizando"
" energía biónica. Está diseñado para un uso continuo y puede causar algunos "
"efectos secundarios desagradables si se lo apaga."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger Lighter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo Encendedor"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo Encendedor"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dedo Encendedor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Finger Lighter CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' index "
"fingers."
msgstr ""
"Son unos potentes iniciadores de fuego que se extienden desde las puntas de "
"los dedos índices de ambas manos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerpick CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-ganzúa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-ganzúa"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dedo-ganzúa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingerpick CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electronic lockpick that is embedded in a fingertip.  This automatic "
"system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks without any "
"skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr ""
"Es una ganzúa electrónica incorporada en un dedo. Este sistema automático te"
" permite abrir rápidamente la mayoría de las cerraduras más complicadas, sin"
" usar ninguna de tus habilidades."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad electromagnética"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad electromagnética"
msgstr[2] "MCB Unidad electromagnética"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electromagnetic Unit CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A powerful electromagnet that is implanted into the user's right hand, "
"allowing them to indiscriminately pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"them.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""
"Es un poderoso electromagneto implantado en la mano derecha del usuario, que"
" permite atraer objetos magnéticos indiscriminadamente. Aquellos "
"desafortunados que estén cerca cuando sucede esto, pueden resultar heridos o"
" muertos por los objetos."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Nictating Membrane CBM"
msgid_plural "Nictating Membrane CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Membrana nictitante"
msgstr[1] "MCB Membrana nictitante"
msgstr[2] "MCB Membrana nictitante"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nictating Membrane CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin membrane that closes over the eyes while underwater, negating any "
"vision penalties."
msgstr ""
"Es una membrana fina que cubre los ojos bajo el agua, lo que permite evitar "
"las penalidades a la visión."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Bancos mejorados de memoria"
msgstr[1] "MCB Bancos mejorados de memoria"
msgstr[2] "MCB Bancos mejorados de memoria"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Enhanced Memory Banks CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  "
"While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills, and give "
"them near-perfect memory of skills."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de unidades de almacenamiento cuántico altamente avanzadas "
"utilizadas para mejorar la memoria.  Mientras estén activas, aumentan la "
"velocidad a la que el usuario aprende habilidades y le proporcionan una "
"memoria casi perfecta de las mismas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid_plural "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Intercambio metabólico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Intercambio metabólico"
msgstr[2] "MCB Intercambio metabólico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metabolic Interchange CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module interconnects the user's digestive system and power supply, "
"letting them replenish bionic energy by burning calories."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo interconecta el sistema digestivo del usuario con la "
"alimentación de energía, permitiendo reponer la energía biónica al quemar "
"calorías."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid_plural "Repair Nanobots CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Nanobots de reparación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Nanobots de reparación"
msgstr[2] "MCB Nanobots de reparación"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Repair Nanobots CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they will reduce the "
"intensity of one bleed effect every 30 seconds, and heal all injured body "
"parts by 1 HP (or broken limbs by 1%) every 2 minutes if you have 3 kJ "
"bionic power and 5 kcal per body part.  If you don't have enough, they will "
"prioritize based on the resources you have."
msgstr ""
"Una flota de robots diminutos inactivos. Mientras estén activados, reducirán"
" la intensidad de un efecto de sangrado cada 30 segundos y sanarán todas las"
" partes del cuerpo lesionadas en 1 PV (o extremidades fracturadas en un 1%) "
"cada 2 minutos, si tienes 3 kJ de energía biónica y 5 kcal por parte del "
"cuerpo.  Si no tienes suficientes, priorizarán en función de los recursos "
"que tengas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador artificial de noche"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador artificial de noche"
msgstr[2] "MCB Generador artificial de noche"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Artificial Night Generator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 15 tile radius "
"through destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activado, este biónico elimina toda la luz en un radio de 15 "
"espacios mediante interferencia destructiva."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Implante de visión nocturna"
msgstr[1] "MCB Implante de visión nocturna"
msgstr[2] "MCB Implante de visión nocturna"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Implanted Night Vision CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module modifies the user's eyes to amplify existing light, "
"allowing them to see in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico modifica los ojos del usuario para amplificar la luz "
"existente, lo que le permite ver en la oscuridad."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de defensa ofensiva"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de defensa ofensiva"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de defensa ofensiva"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Offensive Defense System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield gets projected around the user's body, continually "
"draining power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a "
"strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un campo fino de fuerza rodea el cuerpo del usuario, consumiendo energía. "
"Este campo no desvía los ataques, sino que provoca un shock eléctrico "
"fuerte, causando daño a los atacantes desarmados o a los que tengan armas "
"conductoras."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid_plural "Sensory Dulling CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Adormecimiento sensorial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Adormecimiento sensorial"
msgstr[2] "MCB Adormecimiento sensorial"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sensory Dulling CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module lets the user's nervous system inhibit pain signals, allowing "
"them to dull their senses at will.  However, the use of this system may "
"cause delayed reaction times and drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo permite que el sistema nervioso del usuario inhiba las señales "
"de dolor, lo que le permite adormecer sus sentidos cuando quiera. Sin "
"embargo, el uso de este sistema puede causar tiempos de reacción lentas y "
"somnolencia."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Interfaz de armadura de poder"
msgstr[1] "MCB Interfaz de armadura de poder"
msgstr[2] "MCB Interfaz de armadura de poder"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Armor Interface CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks.  Twice as efficient as using a UPS."
msgstr ""
"Interconecta el sistema de poder biónico del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de las servoarmaduras, permitiéndoles aprovechar las baterías de "
"poder biónico del usuario. Es dos veces más eficiente que usar un UPS."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Interfaz Mk. II de armadura de poder"
msgstr[1] "MCB Interfaz Mk. II de armadura de poder"
msgstr[2] "MCB Interfaz Mk. II de armadura de poder"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks.  Four times as efficient as using a UPS, the Mk. II was designed by "
"DoubleTech Inc., to meet the popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."
msgstr ""
"Interconecta el sistema de poder biónico del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de las servoarmaduras, permitiéndoles aprovechar las baterías de "
"poder biónico del usuario. Cuatro veces más eficiente que usar un UPS, el "
"Mk. II fue diseñado por DoubleTech Inc. para satisfacer la popularidad de la"
" serie de servoarmaduras Mk. II."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía"
msgstr[1] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía"
msgstr[2] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Storage CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power capacity by 100 "
"units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered "
"bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Es un Módulo Compacto de Biónicos que incrementa el almacenamiento de "
"energía del usuario en 100 unidades. Tener por lo menos uno de estos es un "
"requisito para poder usar biónicos que necesitan energía. El usuario también"
" va a necesitar una fuente de energía, que se encuentra en varios MCB."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía Mk. II"
msgstr[2] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Power Storage CBM Mk. II'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement"
" for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases the user's power "
"capacity by 250 units."
msgstr ""
"Es un Módulo Compacto de Biónicos diseñado en las industrias DoubleTech como"
" reemplazo del exitoso MCB Almacenamiento de energía. Incrementa el "
"almacenamiento de energía en 250 unidades."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid_plural "Probability Travel CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Barrera de potencial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Barrera de potencial"
msgstr[2] "MCB Barrera de potencial"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Probability Travel CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through"
" walls, reappearing on the other side.  Once installed, activate and select "
"a direction to use.  Tunneling costs 100 bionic power per tile traveled "
"through."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la longitud de onda del cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario atravesar "
"paredes mediante túneles cuánticos, reapareciendo al otro lado.  Una vez "
"instalado, activa y selecciona una dirección para usar.  Hacer túneles "
"cuesta 100 puntos de poder biónico por cada casilla atravesada."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Air Filtration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de filtrado de aire"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de filtrado de aire"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de filtrado de aire"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Air Filtration System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced filtration system that is implanted in the trachea.  If toxins, "
"or airborne diseases find their way into the windpipe, the filter will "
"attempt to remove them."
msgstr ""
"Se ha instalado un sistema avanzado de filtración en la tráquea del usuario."
" Si alguna toxina o enfermedad transmitida por el aire se mete por ella, el "
"filtró intentará eliminarla."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid_plural "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de limpieza de radiación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de limpieza de radiación"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de limpieza de radiación"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Railgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Railgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Cañón de riel"
msgstr[1] "MCB Cañón de riel"
msgstr[2] "MCB Cañón de riel"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Railgun CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"EM field generators in the user's arms increase the range and damage of "
"thrown magnetic objects at a cost of 1 bionic power per throw.  They will "
"create a trail of electricity that can cause additional damage."
msgstr ""
"Unos generadores de campos electromagnéticos en los brazos del usuario, "
"incrementan la distancia y el daño de los objetos magnéticos lanzados, con "
"un costo de 1 unidad de energía biónica por lanzamiento. Crearán una estela "
"de electricidad que puede causar un daño adicional."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingertip Razors CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Uñas-navaja"
msgstr[1] "MCB Uñas-navaja"
msgstr[2] "MCB Uñas-navaja"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fingertip Razors CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are "
"implanted underneath the fingernails.  These will deal a fair amount of "
"unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered, and "
"allow the user to somewhat precisely slice things apart."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diez garras afiladas de doble filo de cuatro centímetros de "
"longitud, implantadas debajo de las uñas.  Estas causarán una cantidad "
"considerable de daño cortante desarmado siempre que las yemas de los dedos "
"del usuario estén descubiertas y permitirán al usuario cortar cosas con "
"cierta precisión."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell able to convert gasoline to bionic power.  It's "
"connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to "
"500 ml of gasoline."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña celda de combustible que puede convertir la nafta en energía "
"biónica. Está conectada a una red de vejigas bioplásticas capaces de cargar "
"hasta 500ml de nafta."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hydrogen Fuel Cell CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small hydrogen fuel cell able to generate bionic power at a decent rate of"
" efficiency.  It's connected to a diffuse network of compressors and compact"
" canisters able to hold up to 2 liters of hydrogen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Microreactor CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Microreactor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Microreactor Interno"
msgstr[1] "MCB Microreactor Interno"
msgstr[2] "MCB Microreactor Interno"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Microreactor CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This stripped down mini-reactor will generate impressive amounts of bionic "
"power, but may not be the safest thing to install.  1 plutonium fuel cell "
"provides 1000 charges producing 10kW of power.  Produces 50W of power while "
"inactive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Advanced Microreactor CBM"
msgid_plural "Advanced Microreactor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Microreactor Mejorado"
msgstr[1] "MCB Microreactor Mejorado"
msgstr[2] "MCB Microreactor Mejorado"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Advanced Microreactor CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module upgrades a pre-installed microreactor with enhanced maximum "
"yield and limited automatic radiation scrubbing capabilities.  1 plutonium "
"fuel cell provides 1500 charges producing 10kW of power.  Produces 75W of "
"power while inactive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Micro Reactor Safety Override CBM"
msgid_plural "Micro Reactor Safety Override CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Micro Reactor Safety Override CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Disables the radiation safety protocols allowing for much higher energy "
"production.  While active produces 40kJ of power a turn and 1 irradiated "
"stack every 20 turns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Atomic Battery CBM"
msgid_plural "Atomic Battery CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Atomic Battery CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
" Effectively a plutonium fuel cell converted into an alphavoltaic battery, "
"this bionic will provide a limitless source of power at a steady 50 watts "
"when active, with only minimal exposure to radiation while in use."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Atomic Battery Upgrade CBM"
msgid_plural "Atomic Battery Upgrade CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Atomic Battery Upgrade CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A kit for upgrading a pre-installed atomic battery into a Microreactor, "
"providing options for significantly more power generation potential and fuel"
" capacity at the cost of increased radiation exposure."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Microreactor Upgrade CBM"
msgid_plural "Microreactor Upgrade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Mejora de Microreactor"
msgstr[1] "MCB Mejora de Microreactor"
msgstr[2] "MCB Mejora de Microreactor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Microreactor Upgrade CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A kit for upgrading a pre-installed microreactor with enhanced maximum yield"
" and limited automatic radiation scrubbing capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo que mejora un microreactor previamente instalado con una "
"producción máxima incrementada y capacidades limitadas de limpieza "
"automática de radiación."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Recycler Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de reciclado"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de reciclado"
msgstr[2] "MCB Unidad de reciclado"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Recycler Unit CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A series of filters and processors that is implanted in the user's digestive"
" system, allowing them to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de filtros y procesadores son implantados en el sistema digestivo "
"del usuario, lo que le permite recuperar líquido desperdiciado y, en menor "
"medida, nutrientes. En definitiva, causa menor necesidad de comer y tomar."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid_plural "Remote Controller CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Controlador Remoto"
msgstr[1] "MCB Controlador Remoto"
msgstr[2] "MCB Controlador Remoto"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Remote Controller CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to "
"interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño módulo que se conecta al cerebro del usuario y le permite "
"interactuar con dispositivos cercanos de manera inalámbrica."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid_plural "Sonic Resonator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Resonador sónico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Resonador sónico"
msgstr[2] "MCB Resonador sónico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sonic Resonator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high "
"power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage "
"to creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo le permite al cuerpo del usuario resonar con mucha fuerza, "
"creando una onda sísmica de corto alcance. Aunque no le hará mucho daño a "
"las criaturas, los objetos sólidos como paredes y puertas serán dañados."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid_plural "Olfactory Mask CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Máscara olfativa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Máscara olfativa"
msgstr[2] "MCB Máscara olfativa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Olfactory Mask CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor,"
" making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este sistema esté encendido, el cuerpo del usuario producirá muy "
"poco olor, haciendo que sea casi imposible que las criaturas puedan "
"rastrearlo con su olfato."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electroshock Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de electroshock"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de electroshock"
msgstr[2] "MCB Unidad de electroshock"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electroshock Unit CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting "
"extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"Mientras pelee sin armas o con un arma que conduce la electricidad, habrá "
"una pequeña probabilidad de que un golpe le de una descarga al oponente, "
"causándole más daño e incapacitándolo temporalmente, todo por un gasto de "
"energía."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Shockwave Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador de onda sísmica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador de onda sísmica"
msgstr[2] "MCB Generador de onda sísmica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shockwave Generator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby "
"creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun "
"upon impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they "
"collide with."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo genera una onda sísmica poderosa, empujando todas las criaturas "
"cercanas. Los objetivos serán dañados, aturdidos brevemente, golpeados en el"
" impacto contra el terreno intransitable, y empujarán a otras criaturas con "
"las que choquen."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Acelerador de sinapsis"
msgstr[1] "MCB Acelerador de sinapsis"
msgstr[2] "MCB Acelerador de sinapsis"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Synaptic Accelerator CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators that enhance the nervous system, granting a 10% boost to "
"your speed."
msgstr ""
"Son unos estimuladores biónicos que mejoran el sistema nervioso, otorgando "
"un 10% de bonus a la velocidad."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid_plural "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Aumento muscular"
msgstr[1] "MCB Aumento muscular"
msgstr[2] "MCB Aumento muscular"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Muscle Augmentation CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Myomer fibers that enhance the muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"Son unas fibras de myomer que mejoran el sistema muscular, otorgando un +2 "
"de bonus a la fuerza."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid_plural "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Escalpelo Quirúrgico Autónomo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Escalpelos Quirúrgicos Autónomos"
msgstr[2] "MCB Escalpelos Quirúrgicos Autónomos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of surgical grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers."
"  They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality "
"butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Es un sistema de escalpelos quirúrgicos implantados en los dedos del "
"usuario. Le permiten realizar cortes precisos automatizados y pueden ser "
"usados como una herramienta de carneo de alta calidad."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Compensadores anti-reflejo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Compensadores anti-reflejo"
msgstr[2] "MCB Compensadores anti-reflejo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Anti-Glare Compensators CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of quick-reacting transition lenses that are installed over the user's"
" eyes.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect from bright flashes, "
"and protect the eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Son unos lentes de transición de reacción rápida instalados sobre los ojos "
"del usuario. Cancelan las penalidades de los reflejos, protegen parcialmente"
" de los destellos brillantes y sirven para soldar."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de selección de objetivo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de selección de objetivo"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de selección de objetivo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Targeting System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module contains range finders and synchronizes the movement of "
"the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico contiene telémetros y sincroniza el movimiento de los "
"ojos del usuario con sus brazos, en cierta medida. Los disparos realizados "
"serán mucho más preciso, particularmente a grandes distancias."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de teletransportación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de teletransportación"
msgstr[2] "MCB Unidad de teletransportación"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Teleportation Unit CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random direction at the cost"
" of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side"
" effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dilación del tiempo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dilación del tiempo"
msgstr[2] "MCB Dilación del tiempo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Time Dilation CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, the user may increase their body "
"speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  Violent or "
"rapid movements may cause damage due to friction."
msgstr ""
"Gastando toda la energía biónica almacenada, el usuario puede incrementar "
"dramáticamente la velocidad de su cuerpo y sus reacciones, prácticamente "
"deteniendo el tiempo. Los movimientos rápidos o violentes pueden causar daño"
" debido a la fricción."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Toolset CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Toolset CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Caja de herramientas integrada"
msgstr[1] "MCB Caja de herramientas integrada"
msgstr[2] "MCB Caja de herramientas integrada"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Toolset CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A surgically implanted set of tools - screwdriver, hammer, wrench, hacksaw, "
"drill, welder and heating elements.  These can be used in place of many "
"tools when crafting."
msgstr ""
"Es un juego de herramientas quirúrgicamente implantado - destornillador, "
"martillo, llave inglesa, sierra, taladro, soldadora y resistencias térmicas."
" Estas herramientas pueden ser utilizadas al fabricar cosas."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Articulaciones cinéticas"
msgstr[1] "MCB Articulaciones cinéticas"
msgstr[2] "MCB Articulaciones cinéticas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate power "
"when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but movement "
"will require more effort."
msgstr ""
"Unos engranajes reemplazan las articulaciones del usuario para generar "
"lentamente energía al moverse. Pueden activarse para generar más energía, "
"pero el movimiento requerirá más esfuerzo."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Servo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Articulaciones Servo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Articulaciones Servo"
msgstr[2] "MCB Articulaciones Servo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Joint Servo CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors that get installed on leg joints to provide power-"
"assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also "
"requires less effort while this bionic is active.  In passive mode, it "
"provides a smaller benefit by enforcing optimal movement technique."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Evasión asombrosa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Evasión asombrosa"
msgstr[2] "MCB Evasión asombrosa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Uncanny Dodge CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, increasing their "
"ability to dodge while active.  Dodge skill will also allow evading attacks "
"beyond normal human capability, such as bullets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB UPS"
msgstr[1] "MCB UPS"
msgstr[2] "MCB UPS"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Unified Power System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Unified Power System that is wired into the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Objects that run on a UPS can now directly draw power from the bionic power "
"supply."
msgstr ""
"Es un sistema de alimentación ininterrumpida conectada al almacenamiento de "
"energía del usuario. Los objetos que funcionan con un UPS podrán funcionar "
"directamente del suministro de energía biónica."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Underwater Propellers CBM"
msgid_plural "Underwater Propellers CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Underwater Propellers CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of underwater propellers that can be extended or retracted from the "
"users upper torso.  When extended, they grant increased movement speeds if "
"the user is submerged."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de extracción de agua"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de extracción de agua"
msgstr[2] "MCB Unidad de extracción de agua"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Water Extraction Unit CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module contains nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the hand to "
"pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and "
"convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo contiene nanotubos que son instalados en la palma de la mano "
"para bombear cualquier fluido de un cadáver, limpiarlo de impurezas y "
"convertirlo en agua potable. No trae incluido un recipiente para el agua."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
msgid_plural "Intravenous Needletip CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB de Aguja Intravenosa"
msgstr[1] "MCB de Aguja Intravenosa"
msgstr[2] "MCB de Aguja Intravenosa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Intravenous Needletip CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny "
"hoses instead of a plunger.  Installed, it allows the user to draw "
"substances directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño tubo con una aguja retráctil, que termina en una red de "
"pequeñas mangueritas en lugar de un émbolo. Al ser instalado, le permite al "
"usuario extraer sustancias directamente de su corriente sanguínea como si "
"fuera una jeringa."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Skeletal Bracing CBM"
msgid_plural "Skeletal Bracing CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skeletal Bracing CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal "
"structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, "
"allowing the user to carry more weight."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de bisagras, resortes y otros aparatos sintéticos para la "
"estructura esquelética. Estas mejoras artificiales fortalecen las rodillas y"
" los codos, lo que le permite al usuario soportar más peso."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBM"
msgid_plural "Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Amortiguadores Cinéticos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Amortiguadores Cinéticos"
msgstr[2] "MCB Amortiguadores Cinéticos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of hydraulic springs and foldable padding that replaces most of the "
"flesh in the limbs and upper torso.  While active, these absorbers will "
"negate damage from severe impacts such as falling, at the cost of reducing "
"the user's ability to move effectively."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de resortes hidráulicos y almohadillas plegables que "
"reemplaza la mayo parte de la carne de los miembros y torso superior del "
"usuario. Cuando está activo, estos amortiguadores absorben todo el daño de "
"impactos severos al caer, pero reduce la habilidad para moverse eficazmente."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Modifier CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Modifier CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Modificador de Gusto"
msgstr[1] "MCB Modificador de Gusto"
msgstr[2] "MCB Modificador de Gusto"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Taste Modifier CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined "
"with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant "
"taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de sensores de alta sensibilidad implantados en la boca del "
"usuario, combinados con un analizador sofisticado. Cuando está activo, "
"bloqueará todo sabor y texturas desagradables usando energía biónica."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Soporific Induction CBM"
msgid_plural "Soporific Induction CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Inducción Soporífera"
msgstr[1] "MCB Inducción Soporífera"
msgstr[2] "MCB Inducción Soporífera"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Soporific Induction CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A microscopic electrode designed to gently stimulate a particular cluster of"
" neurons in the hypothalamus, helping the user to fall asleep."
msgstr ""
"Es un electrodo microscópico diseñado para estimular un grupo de neuronas en"
" el hipotálamo del usuario, ayudándolo a quedarse dormido."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Squeaky Ankles'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "Es un par de biónicos defectuosos que hacen chillidos."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic-Induced Deformity', 'str_pl': 'Bionic-
#. Induced Deformities'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"Es una pila de pedazos de metal rotos que fueron sacados durante una cirugía"
" reconstructiva."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Acidic Discharge'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM has been breached in several places and some acid is leaking from "
"it."
msgstr "Este MCB ha sufrido roturas en varios lugares y está perdiendo ácido."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrical Discharge'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This CBM is a mess of naked wire and burnt resistors."
msgstr "Este MCB es un quilombo de cables pelados y resistores quemados."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrical Drain'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM was wired incorrectly and would drain power from any system "
"connected to it."
msgstr ""
"Este MCB está cableado de manera incorrecta y gastará energía de cualquier "
"sistema al que esté conectado."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Itchy Metal Thing'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but it's a very awkward "
"thing to have in one's body."
msgstr ""
"No podés reconocer que se supone que es esto, pero es algo muy incómodo para"
" tener metido en el cuerpo."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glowy Thing'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "It's a… thing?  And it glows, at least it did when it was plugged in."
msgstr ""
"Es una... ¿cosa? Que brilla, por lo menos lo hacía cuando estaba enchufada."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leaky Bionic'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"Es un lío de caños agujereados y sellos rotos, y está perdiendo algo "
"desagradable."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Noisemaker'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  When powered, it occasionally emits a loud burst "
"of noise."
msgstr ""
"Es un biónico que funciona mal. Cuando está activado, emitirá ocasionalmente"
" un ruido muy fuerte."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Nostril'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This thing was up someone's nose, they're probably glad to be rid of it."
msgstr ""
"Esta cosa estaba adentro de la nariz de alguien, que debe estar contento de "
"habérselo sacado."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Visual Impairment'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "Es un biónico defectuoso que afecta la visión."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Power Overload'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr ""
"Es un grupo de circuitos defectuosos que son propensos a causar "
"cortocircuito."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Short Circuit'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This bionic is poorly wired and occasionally short-circuits."
msgstr "Este biónico está mal conectado y ocasionalmente, hace cortocircuito."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Endocrine Enervator'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This malfunctioning bionic causes fatigue by altering the unfortunate user's"
" brain chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Este biónico defectuoso causa fatiga al alterar la química del desafortunado"
" usuario."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Regeneration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"
msgstr[2] "MCB Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Synaptic Regeneration System CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic stimulator has been surgically implanted on the back of "
"your head and along your spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's"
" active, you won't become sleep deprived; and if you're sleep deprived "
"already, it will boost the rate of recovery."
msgstr ""
"Un potenciador electromagnético que ha sido implantado quirúrgicamente en tu"
" nuca y espina, drenando energía constantemente. Mientras esté activo, no "
"notarás falta de sueño, y si ya tienes falta de sueño, aumentará tu ratio de"
" recuperación."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Motor Control Overstimulator'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The result of poor configuration, this bionic module frequently causes "
"debilitating muscle spasms."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de una mala configuración, este módulo causa frecuentemente "
"espasmos musculares debilitantes."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wire-Induced Stiffness', 'str_pl': 'Wire-Induced
#. Stiffnesses'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "Son unos cables mal instalados que pueden causar rigidez."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Self-Locking Thumbs'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "Es un par de pulgares biónicos defectuosos y auto-trabables."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Visual Disruptor'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de biónicos oculares defectuosos que causan distorsión visual y "
"pixelación."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Voice Remodulator'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Part of the autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package', this bionic gives the user "
"a creepy robot voice."
msgstr ""
"Es parte del 'Paquete de Identidad Androide' del autodoc, este biónico le "
"otorga al usuario una voz robótica y espeluznante."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Solar Panels CBM"
msgid_plural "Solar Panels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Paneles solares"
msgstr[1] "MCB Paneles solares"
msgstr[2] "MCB Paneles solares"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Solar Panels CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable solar panels.  When in direct"
" sunlight, they will automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power "
"level."
msgstr ""
"En tu espalda hay instalado un conjunto de paneles solares retráctiles. "
"Cuando les da la luz solar directamente, se despliegan automáticamente y se "
"recargan hasta alcanzar tu nivel de energía."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM"
msgid_plural "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Lanzagranadas desplegable"
msgstr[1] "MCBs Lanzagranadas desplegable"
msgstr[2] "MCBs Lanzagranadas desplegable"

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
msgid_plural "Linguistic Coprocessor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Coprocesador Lingüístico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Coprocesador Lingüístico"
msgstr[2] "MCB Coprocesador Lingüístico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Linguistic Coprocessor CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A microcomputer installed into the left hemisphere of your brain to increase"
" the speed that it processes language.  When installed, it provides a "
"passive boost to reading speed."
msgstr ""
"Es una microcomputadora instalada en el hemisferio izquierdo de tu cerebro "
"para incrementar la velocidad de procesamiento de lenguaje. Cuando está "
"instalado, acelera tu velocidad de lectura."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
msgid_plural "Dopamine Stimulators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Simulador de Dopamina"
msgstr[1] "MCB Simulador de Dopamina"
msgstr[2] "MCB Simulador de Dopamina"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dopamine Stimulators CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward center "
"of your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit "
"of dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and "
"suppressing fear."
msgstr ""
"Son un conjunto de pequeños estimuladores nervales biónicos instalados en el"
" centro de recompensa de tu cerebro. Cuando se lo alimenta con energía "
"biónica, periódicamente libera dopamina y otros químicos, induciendo un "
"estado de euforia y eliminando el miedo."

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fusion Blaster Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Fusion Blaster Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Brazo de pistola de fusión"
msgstr[1] "MCB Brazo de pistola de fusión"
msgstr[2] "MCB Brazo de pistola de fusión"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fusion Blaster Arm CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Heavy-duty fusion blaster was integrated into your left arm!  You may use "
"your energy banks to fire a damaging heat ray."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electrosense CBM"
msgid_plural "Electrosense CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electrosense CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced set of digital scanning equipment for reading electrical "
"signals.  When installed it can be activated to scan nearby corpses for "
"bionics, with the added bonus of detecting robots and creatures charged with"
" electricity through walls.  A secondary mode allows it to assist with "
"electrical work like a voltmeter, for checking and modifying grid "
"connections."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Perpetual Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Perpetual Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "bird litter"
msgid_plural "bird litter"
msgstr[0] "basura de pájaro"
msgstr[1] "basura de pájaro"
msgstr[2] "basura de pájaro"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bird litter'}
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Bird dropping, feathers, and soiled bits of rubbish."
msgstr "Son cagadas, plumas y pedazos mugre de pájaro."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "cow pie"
msgid_plural "cow pies"
msgstr[0] "torta de vaca"
msgstr[1] "tortas de vaca"
msgstr[2] "tortas de vaca"

#. ~ Description for cow pie
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "A fresh cow pie, could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr ""
"Una torta de vaca recién hechita, podría ser usada para hacer muy buen "
"fertilizante."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "dog dung"
msgid_plural "dog dungs"
msgstr[0] "sorete de perro"
msgstr[1] "soretes de perro"
msgstr[2] "soretes de perro"

#. ~ Description for dog dung
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Droppings from a canine."
msgstr "Son las deposiciones de un canino."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "manure"
msgid_plural "manures"
msgstr[0] "bosta"
msgstr[1] "bostas"
msgstr[2] "bostas"

#. ~ Description for manure
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Common manure, could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr ""
"Abono común, seguramente podría ser utilizado como un gran fertilizante."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "roach dirt"
msgid_plural "roach dirts"
msgstr[0] "mugre de cucaracha"
msgstr[1] "mugres de cucaracha"
msgstr[2] "mugres de cucaracha"

#. ~ Description for roach dirt
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Large black pellets of rotting material."
msgstr "Son bolitas grandes y negras de materia en descomposición."

#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "fetid goop"
msgid_plural "fetid goops"
msgstr[0] "pegote fétido"
msgstr[1] "pegotes fétidos"
msgstr[2] "pegotes fétidos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fetid goop'}
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"A foul smelling goop.  It has a disgusting texture and a powerful smell that"
" overrides every other smell around it."
msgstr ""
"Es un pego te olor horrendo. Tiene una textura desagradable y un olor tan "
"potente que tapa cualquier otro olor cercano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'anesthetic'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered"
" manually.  You can reload an anesthesia kit with it."
msgstr ""
"Es una variedad de poderosas drogas hipnóticas, analgésicas y estimulantes. "
"Está pensado para ser utilizado con equipamiento médico especializado, y no "
"puede administrarse manualmente. Se puede usar para recargar un equipo de "
"anestesia."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sulfur"
msgid_plural "sulfur"
msgstr[0] "azúfre"
msgstr[1] "azúfre"
msgstr[2] "azúfre"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sulfur'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of pure sulfur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulfur is "
"sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic "
"smoke, that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidized to make "
"paper-bleaching agents."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de azufre puro. Principalmente usado para hacer ácido de "
"batería, el azufre a veces se usa como combustible para explosivos. Puede "
"quemarse para producir humo ácido, que es mortal para las bacterias y "
"también para los humanos, o puede ser oxidado para hacer agentes "
"blanqueadores de papel."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "chunk of sulfur"
msgid_plural "chunks of sulfur"
msgstr[0] "pedazo de azufre"
msgstr[1] "pedazos de azufre"
msgstr[2] "pedazos de azufre"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of sulfur', 'str_pl': 'chunks of sulfur'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of pure sulfur.  Break it up to use it.  Slinging it at someone "
"might give their eyes some nasty burns."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "cement"
msgid_plural "cement"
msgstr[0] "cemento"
msgstr[1] "cemento"
msgstr[2] "cemento"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cement'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Portland is most likely long gone, but its memory persists in cement.  This "
"ubiquitous binder can be used for all kinds of advanced masonry.  Just add "
"water."
msgstr ""
"El pórtland ha muerto... pero su memoria vive en el cemento. Este "
"aglutinante ubicuo puede ser utilizado en cualquier acto de albañilería. "
"Solo hay que agregarle agua."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "limestone"
msgid_plural "limestone"
msgstr[0] "caliza"
msgstr[1] "caliza"
msgstr[2] "caliza"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'limestone'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of small chunks of limestone.  Useful for experiments at science "
"fairs, or fired out of a slingshot.  Maybe something could be crafted from "
"this stuff…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "quicklime"
msgid_plural "quicklime"
msgstr[0] "cal"
msgstr[1] "cal"
msgstr[2] "cal"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'quicklime'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"The product of burning limestone, this white powder is a crucial ingredient "
"in making cement.  That said, it is also extremely caustic and will cause "
"severe burns to any tissue it comes in contact with.  This property could "
"probably be exploited."
msgstr ""
"Es el resultado de quemar la caliza. Este polvo blanco es un ingrediente "
"esencial para hacer cemento. Dicho esto, hay que decir también que es "
"extremadamente cáustica y que quemará cualquier tejido orgánico que toque. "
"Esta característica puede ser aprovechada."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sand'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of New England sand.  If you had a stoked furnace, you could turn "
"it into glass or cement.  Otherwise, it's only good for sanding wood."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "soil"
msgid_plural "soil"
msgstr[0] "tierra"
msgstr[1] "tierra"
msgstr[2] "tierra"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'soil'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A pile of loosely packed, slightly damp loamy soil.  This mixture of sand, "
"silt and clay is ideal for growing plants."
msgstr ""
"Una pila de tierra margosa algo húmeda, holgadamente empaquetada. Esta "
"mezcla de arena, limo y arcilla es ideal para hacer crecer las plantas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "limestone shard"
msgid_plural "limestone shards"
msgstr[0] "fragmento de caliza"
msgstr[1] "fragmentos de caliza"
msgstr[2] "fragmentos de caliza"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'limestone shard'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A small shard of limestone.  Pretty flimsy and not much of a weapon, but its"
" alkaline properties may yet find some use."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño fragmento de caliza. Muy poco sólido y no sirve como arma, pero "
"sus propiedades alcalinas pueden tener alguna utilidad."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "rock salt"
msgid_plural "rock salt"
msgstr[0] "sal de roca"
msgstr[1] "sal de roca"
msgstr[2] "sal de roca"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rock salt'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A handful of rock salt crystals.  Could be refined into table salt."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de cristales de sal de roca. Puede ser refinada para hacer sal "
"de mesa."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "rhodonite"
msgid_plural "rhodonite"
msgstr[0] "rodonita"
msgstr[1] "rodonita"
msgstr[2] "rodonita"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rhodonite'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of rhodonite.  It has manganese dioxide covering and going through "
"it in veins, which can be obtained using a chisel."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de rodonita. Está cubierto de óxido de manganeso y también "
"tiene adentro, que puede ser obtenido con un cincel."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "zincite"
msgid_plural "zincite"
msgstr[0] "zincita"
msgstr[1] "zincita"
msgstr[2] "zincita"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'zincite'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of zincite.  Could be refined into zinc oxide, then into zinc by "
"reduction with a source of carbon."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de zincita. Puede ser refinado para crear óxido de zinc y luego"
" en zinc por reducción con una fuente de carbono."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "bleach"
msgid_plural "bleach"
msgstr[0] "lejía"
msgstr[1] "lejías"
msgstr[2] "lejías"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bleach'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"This is sodium hypochlorite, a common household cleaning agent.  It is "
"highly unsafe to drink."
msgstr ""
"Es hipoclorito de sodio, un agente limpiador muy común en los hogares. Es "
"muy peligroso bebérselo."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonia"
msgid_plural "ammonia"
msgstr[0] "amoníaco"
msgstr[1] "amoníaco"
msgstr[2] "amoníaco"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ammonia'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"This is ammonium hydroxide, a common household cleaning agent.  It is highly"
" unsafe to drink."
msgstr ""
"Es hidróxido de amonio, un agente limpiador muy común en los hogares. Es muy"
" peligroso bebérselo."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#: data/mods/flowerpots_plus/items/overrides.json
msgid "liquid fertilizer"
msgid_plural "liquid fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "fertilizante líquido"
msgstr[1] "fertilizante líquido"
msgstr[2] "fertilizante líquido"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'liquid fertilizer'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A nutrient rich elixir for plants."
msgstr "Un elixir rico en nutrientes para las plantas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#: data/mods/flowerpots_plus/items/overrides.json
msgid "commercial fertilizer"
msgid_plural "commercial fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "fertilizante comercial"
msgstr[1] "fertilizante comercial"
msgstr[2] "fertilizante comercial"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'commercial fertilizer'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Nutrient rich granules for plants."
msgstr "Unos gránulos ricos en nutrientes para las plantas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "fungicide"
msgid_plural "fungicide"
msgstr[0] "fungicida"
msgstr[1] "fungicida"
msgstr[2] "fungicida"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fungicide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Agricultural grade chemical anti-fungal powder designed to destroy "
"infections in plants."
msgstr ""
"Polvo químico anti-fúngico de grado agrícola, diseñado para destruir las "
"infecciones de las plantas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "insecticide"
msgid_plural "insecticide"
msgstr[0] "insecticida"
msgstr[1] "insecticida"
msgstr[2] "insecticida"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'insecticide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Agricultural-grade chemical insecticide powder designed to eradicate insect "
"pests."
msgstr ""
"Es un polvo químico insecticida agricola, diseñado para erradicar pestes de "
"insectos."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "salt water"
msgid_plural "salt water"
msgstr[0] "agua salada"
msgstr[1] "agua salada"
msgstr[2] "agua salada"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'salt water'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Water with salt added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "Es agua con sal añadida. No sirve para beber."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "soapy water"
msgid_plural "soapy water"
msgstr[0] "agua jabonosa"
msgstr[1] "agua jabonosa"
msgstr[2] "agua jabonosa"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'soapy water'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Water with soap added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "Es agua con jabón agregado. No sirve para tomar."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "acid water"
msgid_plural "acid water"
msgstr[0] "agua ácida"
msgstr[1] "agua ácida"
msgstr[2] "agua ácida"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'acid water'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Water collected during an acid rainstorm.  Don't drink it.  Boiling it "
"concentrates the acid."
msgstr ""
"Agua recolectada durante una tormenta ácida. No te la tomes. Al hervirla se "
"puede concentrar el ácido."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "weak acid water"
msgid_plural "weak acid water"
msgstr[0] "agua levemente ácida"
msgstr[1] "agua levemente ácida"
msgstr[2] "agua levemente ácida"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'weak acid water'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of rain and acid rain.  Don't drink it.  Boiling it concentrates "
"the acid."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla entre lluvia y lluvia ácida. No te la tomes. Al hervirla se puede"
" concentrar el ácido."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "concentrated acid"
msgid_plural "concentrated acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido concentrado"
msgstr[1] "ácido concentrado"
msgstr[2] "ácido concentrado"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'concentrated acid'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Concentrated acid.  Don't drink it."
msgstr "Ácido concentrado. No te lo tomes."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sewage sample"
msgid_plural "sewage samples"
msgstr[0] "muestra de aguas residuales"
msgstr[1] "muestras de aguas residuales"
msgstr[2] "muestras de aguas residuales"

#. ~ Description for sewage sample
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A sample of sewage from a treatment plant.  Gross."
msgstr "Una muestra de agua cloacal de una planta de tratamiento. Un asco."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "aluminum powder"
msgid_plural "aluminum powder"
msgstr[0] "polvo de aluminio"
msgstr[1] "polvo de aluminio"
msgstr[2] "polvo de aluminio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'aluminum powder'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of finely ground aluminum powder.  This strong reducing agent was "
"used in combination with various oxidants for chemical welding and "
"explosives alike.  Just before the Cataclysm, however, it was the basis of "
"virtually all commercial metallic-hued paints and anti-corrosive coatings."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de polvo de aluminio finamente molido. Este potente agente "
"reductor era usad en combinación con varios oxidantes para soldadura química"
" y explosivos. Justo antes del Cataclismo, sin embargo, era la base de casi "
"todas las pinturas comerciales de tono metálico, y cubiertas anticorrosivas."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "zinc oxide"
msgid_plural "zinc oxide"
msgstr[0] "óxido de zinc"
msgstr[1] "óxido de zinc"
msgstr[2] "óxido de zinc"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'zinc oxide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of zinc oxide.  It can be reduced into zinc, or used for some "
"other reactions of its own."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de óxido de zinc. Puede ser reducido a zinc, o ser usado para "
"otras reacciones."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "manganese dioxide"
msgid_plural "manganese dioxide"
msgstr[0] "dióxido de manganeso"
msgstr[1] "dióxido de manganeso"
msgstr[2] "dióxido de manganeso"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'manganese dioxide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of manganese dioxide powder.  Occurring naturally in the mineral "
"pyrolusite, it is used commercially in the production of alkaline and zinc-"
"carbon batteries."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de polvo de óxido de manganeso. Aparece naturalmente en las "
"formaciones de pirolusita., es usado comercialmente en la producción de "
"baterías alcalinas y zinc y carbono."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "potassium chloride"
msgid_plural "potassium chloride"
msgstr[0] "cloruro de potasio"
msgstr[1] "cloruro de potasio"
msgstr[2] "cloruro de potasio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'potassium chloride'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium chloride.  Although it occurs naturally in the "
"mineral sylvite, it can be produced as a byproduct of the reaction of "
"saltpeter and hydrochloric acid.  It can be used for making fertilizer, or "
"potassium hydroxide by way of electrolysis."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de cloruro de potasio. Aunque aparece naturalmente en el "
"mineral silvina, puede obtenerse como derivado de la reacción entre el "
"nitrato de potasio y el ácido clorhídrico. Puede usarse para hacer "
"fertilizante, o hidróxido de potasio por medio de electrolisis."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "potassium hydroxide"
msgid_plural "potassium hydroxide"
msgstr[0] "hidróxido de potasio"
msgstr[1] "hidróxido de potasio"
msgstr[2] "hidróxido de potasio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'potassium hydroxide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium hydroxide.  Commonly called caustic potash, it was "
"mainly used industrially for its caustic nature.  It can be used as an "
"electrolyte in alkaline batteries, among other applications."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de hidróxido de potasio. Comúnmente denominado potasa cáustica,"
" era utilizado industrialmente por su característica cáustica. Puede ser "
"usado como electrolito en las baterías alcalinas, entre otros usos."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sulfuric acid"
msgid_plural "sulfuric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido sulfúrico"
msgstr[1] "ácido sulfúrico"
msgstr[2] "ácido sulfúrico"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sulfuric acid'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Sulfuric acid: viscous, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, particularly "
"to organic matter and evil clowns.  Although used to prepare a number of "
"chemicals, it is mostly known as battery acid, due to its widest commercial "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Ácido sulfúrico: viscoso, de olor fétido y extremadamente corrosivo, en "
"particular para la materia orgánica y los payasos malévolos. Aunque se usa "
"para preparar varios químicas, su uso más conocido es para hacer ácido de "
"batería, debido a su amplio uso comercial."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hydrochloric acid"
msgid_plural "hydrochloric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido hidroclórico"
msgstr[1] "ácido hidroclórico"
msgstr[2] "ácido hidroclórico"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hydrochloric acid'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Hydrochloric acid, also known as muriatic acid.  It is a strong acid that "
"has a distinctive smell, important and frequently used ever since its "
"discovery.  It still has a vast multitude of uses."
msgstr ""
"Es ácido hidroclórico, también conocido como ácido muriático. Es un ácido "
"fuerte con un olor distintivo, importante y usado frecuentemente desde su "
"descubrimiento. Todavía tiene una vasta variedad de usos."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "nitric acid"
msgid_plural "nitric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido nítrico"
msgstr[1] "ácido nítrico"
msgstr[2] "ácido nítrico"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'nitric acid'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Nitric acid, a strong oxidant and extremely corrosive material.  Mainly used"
" in the production of synthetic fertilizers, for etching of circuit boards "
"and in woodworking.  Remains quite useful both for making a vast array of "
"pyrotechnic and explosive agents and as a direct weapon: not many beings "
"enjoy being doused in nitric acid."
msgstr ""
"Ácido nítrico, un potente oxidante y extremadamente corrosivo. "
"Principalmente usado en la producción de fertilizantes sintéticos, para "
"grabado de placas de circuitos, y en carpintería. También sirve para hacer "
"una gran variedad de pirotecnia y agentes explosivos, y también como arma: "
"no hay muchos seres que disfruten ser mojados con ácido nitrítico."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "chromium oxide"
msgid_plural "chromium oxide"
msgstr[0] "óxido de cromo"
msgstr[1] "óxido de cromo"
msgstr[2] "óxido de cromo"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chromium oxide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of chromium oxide.  This substance, typically known as the only "
"stable green pigment for paints, is also a mild oxidizer, which can be mixed"
" with aluminum powder to make thermite for welding.  If one had access to a "
"CVD machine and a laboratory worth of reagents, they might be able to "
"produce very durable ceramic layers."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de óxido de cromo. Esta sustancia, conocida normalmente como el"
" único pigmento verde estable para pintura, es también un oxidante leve, y "
"puede ser mezclado con polvo de aluminio para hacer termita para soldadura. "
"Si se tiene acceso a una máquina de CVD y a los reactivos de un laboratorio,"
" se podría producir capas de cerámica muy resistentes."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "calcium carbide"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide"
msgstr[0] "carburo de calcio"
msgstr[1] "carburo de calcio"
msgstr[2] "carburo de calcio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'calcium carbide'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of calcium carbide, giving off a faint, garlic-like smell.  "
"Commercially, calcium carbide was used for on-the-spot manufacture of "
"acetylene and historically to power acetylene lamps.  If mixed with water "
"and sealed, it will explode with little strength, but with relatively loud "
"noise and could maybe be used as a decoy."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de carburo de calcio, que tiene un leve olor a ajo. "
"Comercialmente, el carburo de calcio era usado para la producción inmediata "
"de acetileno y, antiguamente, para alimentar las lámparas de acetileno. Si "
"se mezcla con agua y se sella, explotará con poca fuerza, pero haciendo "
"mucho ruido. Tal vez pueda usarse como señuelo."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hexamine'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of waxy hexamine tablets.  This ubiquitous fuel was used to start "
"up almost every garden grill and no 'real' camping trip could do its cooking"
" without it, until the Cataclysm.  Nowadays, it is even more valuable than "
"before, being the key component in the preparation of several military-grade"
" explosives."
msgstr ""
"Es un puñado de comprimidos de hexamina. Este combustible ubicuo era usado "
"para encender casi todas las parrillas, y en ningún camping se podía cocinar"
" sin ella, hasta que ocurrió el Cataclismo. Ahora, es aún más valioso que "
"antes, siendo el componente clave en la preparación de varios explosivos de "
"grado militar."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgstr[0] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"
msgstr[1] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"
msgstr[2] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated hydrogen peroxide is a powerful oxidant, violently decomposing "
"in contact with most reducing agents.  Can be used as rocket fuel or to make"
" high explosives.  Causes severe burns to any organic matter and may ignite "
"it on contact."
msgstr ""
"El agua oxigenada concentrada es un potente oxidante, que se descompone "
"violentamente en contacto con la mayoría de los agentes reductores. Se puede"
" usar como combustible de misiles o para hacer explosivos grandes. Causa "
"quemaduras severas a la materia orgánica y puede prenderla fuego al "
"contacto."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonium nitrate"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate"
msgstr[0] "nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[1] "nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[2] "nitrato de amonio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ammonium nitrate'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some ammonium nitrate.  This white, crystalline powder is commonly used as a"
" component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water "
"to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in "
"this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Es un poco de nitrato de amonio. Este polvo blanco y cristalino se utiliza "
"comúnmente como componente en fertilizantes y explosivos. Puede disolverse "
"en agua para bajar bruscamente su temperatura, pero ¿qué utilidad tiene ese "
"atributo en este mundo que tenemos?"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgstr[0] "gránulos de nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[1] "gránulos de nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[2] "gránulos de nitrato de amonio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ammonium nitrate pellets'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some ammonium nitrate pellets.  These pellets are commonly used as a "
"component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water "
"to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in "
"this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Son unos gránulos de nitrato de amonio. Estos gránulos se utilizan "
"comúnmente como componente en fertilizantes y explosivos. Puede disolverse "
"en agua para bajar bruscamente su temperatura, pero ¿qué utilidad tiene ese "
"atributo en este mundo que tenemos?"

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "saltpeter"
msgid_plural "saltpeter"
msgstr[0] "nitrato de potasio"
msgstr[1] "nitrato de potasio"
msgstr[2] "nitrato de potasio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'saltpeter'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of saltpeter.  Sometimes used as a fertilizer, this ubiquitous "
"nitrate is the principal constituent of black gunpowder and simple rocket "
"propellants, such as rocket candy."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de nitrato de potasio. A veces usado como fertilizante, este "
"nitrato ubicuo es el constituyente principal de la pólvora negra y de los "
"propulsores de misiles, como el combustible de caramelo."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "niter"
msgid_plural "niter"
msgstr[0] "nitro"
msgstr[1] "nitro"
msgstr[2] "nitro"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'niter'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A large crystal of niter, the mineral form of potassium nitrate.  It can be "
"processed into saltpeter."
msgstr ""
"Un cristal grande de nitro, la forma mineral de nitrato de potasio.  Puede "
"ser procesado en salitre."

#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "chunk of iron ore"
msgid_plural "chunks of iron ore"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of iron ore', 'str_pl': 'chunks of iron
#. ore'}
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of iron ore, from one source or another.  With the right "
"knowhow, it could be smelted into usable metal."
msgstr ""

