#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ethanol'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Extremely pure alcohol suitable for use as a component in chemical "
"reactions.  You could also water it down and drink it, or use it as fuel in "
"alcohol-burning stoves."
msgstr ""
"Alcohol extremadamente puro, útil para usar como componente en reacciones "
"químicas. También le puedes agregar agua para hacerlo tomable, o usarlo como"
" combustible en cocinas de alcohol."

