"A fully customized chainmail outfit, leaving the head uncovered.  The shirt,"
" arms, and leggings have been modified with straps and combined with a "
"gambeson to deal with uneven weight distribution, cold environments and to "
"allow them to be used separately."
msgstr ""
"Es una armadura completa de cota de malla, que deja la cabeza descubierta. "
"La camisa, mangas y perneras han sido modificadas con correas y combinadas "
"con gambesón para controlar el balance del peso, soportar climas fríos y "
"para permitirte usar las partes por separado."

#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "chainmail armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail armors"
