"A fully customized chainmail suit.  The coif, shirt, arms, and leggings have"
" been modified with straps and combined with a gambeson to deal with uneven "
"weight distribution, cold environments and to allow them to be used "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Es una armadura completa de cota de malla. La cofia, la camisa, mangas y "
"perneras han sido modificadas con correas y combinadas con gambesón para "
"controlar el balance del peso, soportar climas fríos y para permitirte usar "
"las partes por separado."

