#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Fletcher's Friend", 'str_pl': "copies of The
#. Fletcher's Friend"}
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This hefty book is devoted to folks looking to handcraft their own arrows.  "
"It starts with a hip and snappy disclaimer about the risks, both physical "
"and legal, of using explosives and flammable materials.  Look for its "
"companion, \"The Bowyer's Buddy\"!"
msgstr ""
"Este robusto libro está dedicado a los que buscan fabricar sus propias "
"flechas. Empieza con un rápido descargo de responsabilidad acerca de los "
"riesgos, tanto físicos como legales, de usar materiales explosivos e "
"inflamables. ¡Busca el libro complementario, \"El Compañero del Arquero\"!"

