"Strawberries left to ferment with a few other choice ingredients offer up a "
"surprisingly palatable mixture; you barely even have to force yourself to "
"drink it after the first few gulps."
msgstr ""
"Son fresas dejadas a fermentar con otros ingredientes seleccionados, lo que "
"produce una mezcla sorprendentemente sabrosa. Apenas si te tienes que "
"obligar a beberla después de los primeros tragos."

