#. ~ Description for smoked meat
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Tasty meat that has been heavily smoked for preservation.  It could be "
"further smoked to dehydrate it completely."
msgstr ""
"Es una carne sabrosa que ha sido ahumada para preservarla. Puede ser ahumada"
" aún más para deshidratarla completamente."

