"The beverage of gentlemen everywhere, made from applying hot water to leaves"
" of the tea plant /Camellia sinensis/."
msgstr ""
"La bebida del caballero, hecha aplicando agua caliente a hojas de la planta "
"del té, /Camellia sinensis/."

