#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
msgid "Colt Ring Lever Rifle"
msgid_plural "Colt Ring Lever Rifles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/gun/44paper.json
msgid ""
"The Colt Ring Lever Rifle was one of the first true lever-action rifles, "
"designed to utilize the same caplock ammo as Colt revolvers.  It was "
"famously used in the second Seminole war, where the Seminole people had "
"learned to strike American soldiers while they were reloading their muskets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
