msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'extendable quarterstaff (extended)', 'str_pl':
#. 'extendable quarterstaves (extended)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A custom-made telescoping steel quarterstaff, capable of shrinking down to "
"the size of a baton for easy storage.  Its hollow nature makes it more "
"lightweight but less sturdy than a more traditional staff.  It is currently "
"extended."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "spiked survivor club"
msgid_plural "spiked survivor clubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for spiked survivor club
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A wooden club with bands of iron or loops of wire and spikes carefully "
"hammered onto it.  While it's not as effective or fancy as a proper mace or "
"morningstar, its history throughout medieval and even early modern "
"battlefields is noteworthy.  It was also known as a trench club during world"
" war 1."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "bone club"
msgid_plural "bone clubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone club'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"This hefty bludgeon is carved from sturdy bones mounted on a wooden haft, "
"capable of bashing faces in with swiftness and efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "spiked survivor staff"
msgid_plural "spiked survivor staffs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for spiked survivor staff
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A wooden staff with metal bands or a length of wire wrapped onto both ends "
"and various nails or spikes attached to it, including a single wicked spike "
"at the top.  Makeshift weapons have a long history throughout warfare, from "
"the trench clubs of World War 1 to the staffs used by medieval peasants, and"
" hopefully it will help you survive too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "burnt out battletorch"
msgid_plural "burnt out battletorches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'burnt out battletorch', 'str_pl': 'burnt out
#. battletorches'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy wood bat, wrapped in flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  Makes a good "
"melee weapon, but could be disassembled to recycle the baseball bat and some"
" Nomex patches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "battletorch"
msgid_plural "battletorches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'battletorch', 'str_pl': 'battletorches'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "You light the battletorch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'battletorch', 'str_pl': 'battletorches'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"This is sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-resistant"
" Nomex fabric.  Light it, and the ball game will REALLY heat up.  You'll "
"need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr ""
"Es un bate resistente de madera, envuelto con trapos mojados en gasolina y "
"tela ignífuga nomex. Encendelo y el partido se va a poner VERDADERAMENTE "
"caliente. Vas a necesitar un encendedor o fósforos para encenderlo."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "battletorch (lit)"
msgid_plural "battletorches (lit)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'battletorch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'battletorches
#. (lit)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "The battletorch is extinguished."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'battletorch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'battletorches
#. (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-"
"resistant Nomex fabric.  It is burning brightly, and makes it much easier to"
" see the baselines at night games (It also makes the umpire FAR more likely "
"to call a ball instead of a strike)."
msgstr ""
"Es un bate resistente de madera, envuelto con trapos mojados en gasolina y "
"tela ignífuga nomex. Está encendido y brillando, y hace mucho más fácil ver "
"las bases durante los juegos nocturnos (también hace que el umpire tienda "
"más a cobrar la bola como mala que como buena)."

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "wooden greatclub"
msgid_plural "wooden greatclubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden greatclub'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"One of humanity's oldest weapons pushed to an inhuman extreme.  Despite its "
"simplicity, this two-handed club carved from a log requires considerable "
"strength and skill to use effectively."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "ironshod greatclub"
msgid_plural "ironshod greatclubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ironshod greatclub'}
#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid ""
"A massive two-handed club, carved from a log and reinforced with iron bands "
"that give it even more heft.  This weapon embodies the phrase \"like giving "
"a kanabō to an oni\" as anyone capable of using it effectively could likely "
"tear their enemies apart with their bare hands."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid "bionic claws"
msgid_plural "bionic claws"
msgstr[0] "garras biónicas"
msgstr[1] "garras biónicas"
msgstr[2] "garras biónicas"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bionic claws'}
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
