msgid_plural "monofilament whips"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'monofilament whip'}
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid ""
"A long, sharp thread of high-tech material, with a small counterweight at "
"the end."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "generic kitchen knife"
msgid_plural "generic kitchen knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "butcher knife"
msgid_plural "butcher knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de carnicero"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de carnicero"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de carnicero"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'butcher knife', 'str_pl': 'butcher knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a sharp, heavy knife.  It makes a good melee weapon, and is an ideal"
" item for butchering corpses."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo grande y afilado. Sirve bien como arma de cuerpo a cuerpo, y "
"es ideal para descuartizar cadáveres."

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "steak knife"
msgid_plural "steak knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo para carne"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos para carne"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos para carne"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steak knife', 'str_pl': 'steak knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a sharp knife, designed for cutting meat.  It makes a poor melee "
"weapon, but is decent at butchering corpses."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo afilado, diseñado para cortar carne. No sirve mucho como arma"
" de cuerpo a cuerpo, pero es decente para descuartizar cadáveres."

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "paring knife"
msgid_plural "paring knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paring knife', 'str_pl': 'paring knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a short-bladed knife with a sharp blade, made for fine controlled "
"cuts to vegetables without using a cutting board."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "chef knife"
msgid_plural "chef knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chef knife', 'str_pl': 'chef knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a long-bladed kitchen knife.  The blade is wider than the handle, "
"giving room for the wielder's knuckles, and it has a characteristic curve "
"for a fast rocking action for chopping vegetables.  It makes a good melee "
"weapon, but the wide blade is unwieldy for butchering."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "carving knife"
msgid_plural "carving knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carving knife', 'str_pl': 'carving knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a long-bladed kitchen knife with a thin, slightly curved blade for "
"deftly slicing meat either in flat sheets or around the bone.  It would be a"
" decent melee weapon, and excellent for butchery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "bread knife"
msgid_plural "bread knives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bread knife', 'str_pl': 'bread knives'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This knife has quite a long blade with a scalloped edge for cutting bread.  "
"It's not that sharp, but its length and heft mean it could do a bit of "
"damage and cause some nasty tearing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "vegetable cleaver"
msgid_plural "vegetable cleavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vegetable cleaver'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a menacing looking knife with a broad, square shaped blade, curved "
"for fast vegetable chopping.  Its heft and sharpness would make it a decent "
"weapon as well, although not as good as a meat cleaver."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid "meat cleaver"
msgid_plural "meat cleavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'meat cleaver'}
#: data/json/items/melee/knives_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"This is a menacing looking knife with a broad, square shaped blade.  Its "
"heft and sharpness would make it a very effective melee weapon, and an "
"excellent butchering tool."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "bullwhip"
msgid_plural "bullwhips"
msgstr[0] "látigo"
msgstr[1] "látigos"
msgstr[2] "látigos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bullwhip'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long strip of braided leather with a handle on one end.  Originally "
"developed to settle disagreements with cattle, it's better used now for "
"flaying the rotten flesh off of walking corpses.  Great for when a problem "
"comes along."
msgstr ""
"Una larga correa de cuero trenzado con un mango en un extremo. Originalmente"
" diseñado para ordenar el ganado, ahora es mejor usada para despellejar la "
"carne podrida de los cadáveres ambulantes. Muy útil cuando se te vienen los "
"problemas."

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "scourge"
msgid_plural "scourges"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scourge'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"The \"cat 'o nine tails\", a handle with nine short leather whips each "
"sporting a razor-sharp metal tip.  This ancient instrument of torture causes"
" massive bleeding but is an ineffecient weapon by design."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "lobotomizer"
msgid_plural "lobotomizers"
msgstr[0] "lobotomizador"
msgstr[1] "lobotomizadores"
msgstr[2] "lobotomizadores"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lobotomizer'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-forged collapsible tool that has two axe heads and sharp "
"shovel-like tip on one end.  It can be used as a shovel, or you could chop "
"some zombies with it instead."
msgstr ""
"Es un herramienta plegable hecha a mano que tiene dos cabezas de hacha y una"
" punta afilada similar a una pala. Se puede usar como pala, o se pueden "
"triturar algunos zombis, también."

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "glass shiv"
msgid_plural "glass shivs"
msgstr[0] "navaja carcelaria de cristal"
msgstr[1] "navajas carcelarias de cristal"
msgstr[2] "navajas carcelarias de cristal"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass shiv'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "A glass shard with wrapping at one end so it can be safely wielded."
msgstr ""
"Un fragmento de cristal con una punta envuelta con un trapo para que pueda "
"ser empuñado fácilmente."

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "resin shiv"
msgid_plural "resin shivs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'resin shiv'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"a shattered fragment of alien resin, wrapped at one end to make a crude "
"knife.  It's not very durable, but useful in a pinch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic shank"
msgid_plural "plastic shanks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic shank'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An oblong plastic trinket with the far end ground down into a stabbing "
"point."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid "tazer"
msgid_plural "tazers"
msgstr[0] "pistola eléctrica"
msgstr[1] "pistolas eléctricas"
msgstr[2] "pistolas eléctricas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tazer'}
#: data/json/items/melee/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an"
" adjacent enemy, damaging and temporarily paralyzing them.  Because the "
"shock can actually jump through the air, it is difficult to miss."
msgstr ""
"Es una arma de aturdimiento de alta potencia. Usa este objeto para intentar "
"electrocutar a un enemigo adyacente, casuando daño y paralizándolo "
"temporalmente. Como el shock puede conducirse por el aire, es bastante "
"difícil errarle."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pitchfork"
msgid_plural "pitchforks"
msgstr[0] "horca"
msgstr[1] "horcas"
msgstr[2] "horcas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pitchfork'}
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"An agricultural tool with long wooden shaft and four spikes.  Is used to "
"lift hay."
msgstr ""
"Es una herramienta para la agricultura. Es un palo lago con cuatro puntas, y"
" se utiliza para levantar heno."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "pointy stick"
msgid_plural "pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "palo con punta"
msgstr[1] "palos con punta"
msgstr[2] "palos con punta"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pointy stick'}
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A simple wood pole with one end sharpened."
msgstr "Es un simple palo de madera con una punta afilada."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "long pointy stick"
msgid_plural "long pointy sticks"
msgstr[0] "palo largo puntiagudo"
msgstr[1] "palos largos puntiagudos"
msgstr[2] "palos largos puntiagudos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'long pointy stick'}
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A stout wood pole with one end sharpened.  More clunky than a properly-made "
"spear, but still has some heft to it."
msgstr ""
"Una vara de madera robusta con un extremo afilado. Es más tosco que una "
"lanza de verdad, pero aún así tiene algo de firmeza."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "wooden spear"
msgid_plural "wooden spears"
msgstr[0] "lanza de madera"
msgstr[1] "lanzas de madera"
msgstr[2] "lanzas de madera"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden spear'}
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout pole with an improvised grip and a fire-hardened point."
msgstr ""
"Es un palo grueso con un mango improvisado y la punta endurecida al fuego."

#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "spike on a stick"
msgid_plural "spike on a sticks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spike on a stick'}
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
