"This remote-controlled car is on, and draining its batteries just like a "
"real electric car!  Use a remote control to drive it around."
msgstr ""
"Este coche radiocontrol está encendido, ¡y consume las baterías igual que un"
" coche eléctrico real! Usa el control remoto para manejarlo."

