msgid_plural "claw bars"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'claw bar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a small prying tool with a clawed bend at one end for pulling "
"spikes.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying them or to lift "
"manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash some heads in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "concrete mixer"
msgid_plural "concrete mixers"
msgstr[0] "hormigonera"
msgstr[1] "hormigoneras"
msgstr[2] "hormigoneras"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'concrete mixer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A portable concrete mixer.  It is still large and heavy, but it can be "
"operated solo, and runs on batteries.  It also has a heater built in."
msgstr ""
"Es una mezcladora portátil de cemento. Igual, es grande y pesada, pero puede"
" ser operada por una sola persona, y anda con baterías. También tiene un "
"calentador incorporado."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "cordless drill"
msgid_plural "cordless drills"
msgstr[0] "taladro inalámbrico"
msgstr[1] "taladros inalámbricos"
msgstr[2] "taladros inalámbricos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cordless drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a cordless battery-powered drill with a selection of drill bits."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un taladro sin cable, alimentado con baterías, con una variedad de "
"puntas para el taladro."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "distaff and spindle"
msgid_plural "distaves and spindles"
msgstr[0] "huso y aspa"
msgstr[1] "husos y aspas"
msgstr[2] "husos y aspas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'distaff and spindle', 'str_pl': 'distaves and
#. spindles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pair of specialized wooden rods used to spin fibers into thread and yarn."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de palos de madera especializados para hacer hilos y ovillos "
"hilando fibra."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric jackhammer"
msgid_plural "electric jackhammers"
msgstr[0] "martillo neumático eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "martillos neumáticos eléctricos"
msgstr[2] "martillos neumáticos eléctricos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric jackhammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other "
"surfaces.  It runs on a rechargeable cell, optionally compatible with UPS.  "
"Use it to blast a hole in adjacent solid terrain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hacksaw"
msgid_plural "hacksaws"
msgstr[0] "sierra de arco"
msgstr[1] "sierras de arco"
msgstr[2] "sierras de arco"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hacksaw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "This is a sturdy saw, useful for cutting through metal objects."
msgstr "Es una sierra resistente, útil para cortar objetos de metal."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wire saw"
msgid_plural "wire saws"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wire saw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible saw made from thin wire, with simple handles on either "
"end.  It should suffice for light metal and wood sawing, or for cutting "
"chain-link fences."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hammer"
msgid_plural "hammers"
msgstr[0] "martillo"
msgstr[1] "martillos"
msgstr[2] "martillos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a demagnetized steel claw hammer with a wooden grip.  With a hammer,"
" nails, and two by fours in your inventory, you could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows.  It has myriad other uses as well."
msgstr ""
"Es un martillo de carpintero de acero desimantado con un mango de madera. "
"Con un martillo, clavos y tablas de madera en tu inventario, podés bloquear "
"con tablas cualquier puerta o ventana. También tiene miles de otros usos."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bronze hammer"
msgid_plural "bronze hammers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a bronze claw hammer with a wooden grip, commonly used where sparks "
"from a steel hammer might be a safety hazard.  You could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows, among myriad other uses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hand drill"
msgid_plural "hand drills"
msgstr[0] "taladro manual"
msgstr[1] "taladros manuales"
msgstr[2] "taladros manuales"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A primitive manual drill with a single drill bit.  It is slow and it will "
"exhaust you quickly."
msgstr ""
"Es una primitiva agujereadora manual con una sola mecha. Es lenta y "
"agotadora de utilizar."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "rubber hose"
msgid_plural "rubber hoses"
msgstr[0] "manguera de goma"
msgstr[1] "mangueras de goma"
msgstr[2] "mangueras de goma"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rubber hose'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible rubber hose.  It could be used for crafting, or siphoning"
" fuel from a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Es una manguera de goma flexible. Puede ser usada para fabricar alguna cosa,"
" o para chuparle la gasolina a un vehículo."

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "utility maintenance kit"
msgid_plural "utility maintenance kits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'utility maintenance kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A compact kit for probing, joining, and extending fluid grid connections in "
"buildings."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bottle jack"
msgid_plural "bottle jacks"
