#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The American bulldog is a hardy, well built dog, that seems suited for "
"surviving the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"El bulldog americano es un perro fuerte de buena complexión, que parece "
"hecho para sobrevivir el apocalipsis."

