#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable beagle that has managed to survive the apocalypse.  Being agile "
"and small, they are difficult to shoot at.  Generally attacks in packs."
msgstr ""
"Es un adorable beagle que ha logrado sobrevivir en el apocalipsis. Siendo "
"ágiles y pequeños, es difícil pegarles un tiro. Generalmente, atacan en "
"manada."

