msgid ""
"An athletic and hyperactive dog that loves to herd animals and jump, the "
"Border Collie is an agile attacker.  Although they can be easy to train, "
"they don't work well in packs."
msgstr ""
"Es un perro atlético e hiperactivo que ama arrear animales y saltar, el "
"border collie es un ágil atacante. Aunque son fáciles de amaestrar, no "
"funcionan bien en manada."

