#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
msgid ""
"When the government gave up on saving the depths of the city someone decided"
" to use tactical nukes and buy time for the retreat."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
msgid ""
"It blew an opening in the horde roaming the city and allowed me to escape."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
msgid ""
"Every choice has consequences though.  But every consequence is probably "
"worth it, if it's the only way to survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
msgid ""
"I was working in a reactor when something big started smashing everything."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
msgid ""
"My coworkers and I spiked the reactor to prevent the deaths of hundreds of "
"thousands."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
msgid "I guess the other workers are probably all dead anyway now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
msgid ""
"Things were good.  I had a good job working for a zaibatsu.  I was "
"respected, and had people working for me.  I mostly ignored the changes that"
" were happening in the city, they were beneath me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
msgid "So, what happened?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
msgid ""
"Slowly fewer and fewer of the cubicle drones came into the office.  Security"
" notices piled up about routes through the city to avoid.  Finally, one day "
"I came in and you could hear the riots coming closer and some kind of "
"animalistic roars, gigantic animals."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/recent_mutation_1.json
msgid ""
"That last day security and scientists came up from the underground lab and "
"rounded up all the remaining staff.  One of them said that this was the only"
" chance any of us had of surviving.  They started injecting people at "
"gunpoint."
msgstr ""
"Ese último día, el personal de seguridad y los científicos subieron del "
"laboratorio subterráneo y reunieron a todo el personal que quedaba. Uno de "
"ellos dijo que era la única oportunidad que teníamos de sobrevivir. "
"Empezaron a inyectar a la gente a punta de pistola."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
msgid ""
"I was a biohacker by trade before the Cataclysm.  I made a living out of "
"bootlegging medicines, drugs and other copywritten biological products."
msgstr ""
"Antes del cataclismo, yo era biohacker de profesión. Me ganaba la vida "
"contrabandeando medicinas, drogas y otros productos biológicos."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
msgid ""
"Imagine my surprise when I found myself infected with some kind of alien "
"stem cells."
msgstr ""
"Imaginen mi sorpresa cuando me encontré infectado con una especie de células"
" madre alienígenas."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
msgid ""
"It's certainly helped me survive so far.  Was there even a choice not to "
"take advantage of that?"
msgstr ""
"Sin duda me ha ayudado a sobrevivir hasta ahora.  ¿Acaso había opción de no "
"aprovecharlo?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Hey again.  *kzzz*"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I… can move again.  I have a real body!  Is this a body?"
msgstr ""
"Yo... puedo moverme otra vez.  ¡Tengo un cuerpo de verdad!                    \n"
" ¿Este es un cuerpo?"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "So you must have seen some weird stuff?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I built this body and rescued you…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I can put you back in the pieces I found you in."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "No one deserves the hell you've been through.  I hope you find peace."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "*crackle* So why would you do this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "…This is just another torture isn't it!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I went to a lot of trouble to provide you with a body."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *sizzle* I'm sorry!  Don't hurt me again!  Anything to stay away"
" from those fiends!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "…You're one of those mocking monsters!  I'm going to tear you apart!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I don't know what's happening but I'm going back home."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
msgid "I was created to be a billionaire's companion."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
msgid "Their wealth and connections didn't save them."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
msgid ""
"But they built me with the ability to survive a world beyond imagining."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
msgid "But here you are?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
msgid "A resort created a whole line of Uplifts just like me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
msgid ""
"We should have created a whole village of just us away from all the humans "
"once the Cataclysm came."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
msgid "Maybe we did, haha."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
msgid "Why didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
msgid "I grew up on an island with a doctor."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
msgid "I had so many brothers and sisters."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
msgid "We ate him."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
msgid ""
"The zoo designed me to be a link between my original species and humans "
"studying us."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
msgid "I was there when the Cataclysm happened.  Many animals were infected."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
msgid "Zombears are terrifying creatures of destruction."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
msgid ""
"I was part of a black ops paramilitary unit.  I still don't know if I worked"
" for the government or a corporation."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
msgid ""
"My team was sent in to a lab on a purge in fire mission.  The things I saw "
"in there haunt me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
msgid ""
"Others may have survived but I doubt it.  I certainly hope they haven't come"
" back."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm a vatgrown, an almost man, a MacDuff.  I was a product in the Old World."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
msgid ""
"Now there are too few people left to differentiate.  Other than those morons"
" afraid of mutants."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
msgid "Now I choose the cause I'll die for."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid ""
"Staying at the family compounds scattered across New England, we've managed "
"to maintain some organization post Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid ""
"The Whately family has been outcast in these parts for centuries.  But it "
"made us stronger as a family."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "We've been talking to those from other places from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "All the earth was flame in a holocaust of ecstasy and freedom."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid "Hive Ganger"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid ""
"I've survived all my life with the whole world against me, how is this any "
"different."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid "Corporate Wetworks Operative"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/npc_classes_cyborg.json
msgid ""
"I made a good living working in the shadows of the old world.  I can survive"
" it's twilight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/mutant_npcs/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Mastodon Uplift"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/mutant_npcs/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Humans created me.  Let's see what I can be on my own."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Wind Turbines"
msgstr "Turbinas de viento"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cranium Bomb'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You've worked for some nasty people.  People who installed a bomb at the top"
" of your spine.  They are all dead now but there is unfortunately a dead man"
" switch if you don't check in roughly every thirty days.  You need this out "
"and fast."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/obsolete.json
msgid "Precision Solderers"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Precision Solderers'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have been outfitted with precise soldering tools, wire cutters, "
"and cable spools.  They're too small to use in most crafting, but in the "
"absence of proper machinery, they're essential for creating bionics without "
"better tools."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Radio Tower Technician"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Radio Tower Technician"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Radio Tower Technician) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"From your spot at the top of the tower you were working on, you had a good "
"view of the end of the world; of streaks of light falling from the sky, "
"blossoming into mushroom clouds, barely a flicker on the horizon before your"
" optical dampers flicked down.  You rushed to safety before the shockwaves "
"could blast you from your perch.  The bionic implants included with your "
"contract might come in handy now…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Radio Tower Technician) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From your spot at the top of the tower you were working on, you had a good "
"view of the end of the world; of streaks of light falling from the sky, "
"blossoming into mushroom clouds, barely a flicker on the horizon before your"
" optical dampers flicked down.  You rushed to safety before the shockwaves "
"could blast you from your perch.  The bionic implants included with your "
"contract might come in handy now…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cryosleep Survivor"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Cryosleep Survivor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Cryosleep Survivor) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A sudden power failure woke you from the cryosleep sarcophagus in which you "
"had entombed yourself lifetimes ago.  It seems the emergency reanimation "
"procedure has damaged your memory, and now, bearing almost no knowledge of "
"your past life, you must find a way to survive in a ruined and alien world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Cryosleep Survivor) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A sudden power failure woke you from the cryosleep sarcophagus in which you "
"had entombed yourself lifetimes ago.  It seems the emergency reanimation "
"procedure has damaged your memory, and now, bearing almost no knowledge of "
"your past life, you must find a way to survive in a ruined and alien world."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Atomic Pitchman"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Atomic Pitchwoman"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Atomic Pitchman) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You enter now the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered"
" toys."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Atomic Pitchwoman) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You enter now the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered"
" toys."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Planar Frontiersman"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Planar Frontierswoman"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Planar Frontiersman) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
"portal snapped shut and all hell broke loose.  Now that you know what was on"
" the other end, maybe that was a mercy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Planar Frontierswoman) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
"portal snapped shut and all hell broke loose.  Now that you know what was on"
" the other end, maybe that was a mercy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vatgrown Bodyguard"
msgstr "Guardaespaldas Clonado"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Vatgrown Bodyguard"
msgstr "Guardaespaldas Clonada"

#. ~ Profession (male Vatgrown Bodyguard) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata "
"and somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning "
"words to force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first "
"taste of life."
msgstr ""
"Creciste en algún laboratorio corporativo para ser el guardaespaldas "
"perfecto, sin nada más por lo que vivir que tu cliente. El Cataclismo ignoró"
" los estratos sociales y, de algún modo, sobreviviste a tu amo. Ahora nadie "
"conoce las palabras condicionantes para forzar tu obediencia. Mientras el "
"mundo arde, tú tienes tu primer contacto con la vida."

#. ~ Profession (female Vatgrown Bodyguard) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata "
"and somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning "
"words to force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first "
"taste of life."
msgstr ""
"Creciste en algún laboratorio corporativo para ser la guardaespaldas "
"perfecta, sin nada más por lo que vivir que tu cliente. El Cataclismo ignoró"
" los estratos sociales y, de algún modo, sobreviviste a tu amo. Ahora nadie "
"conoce las palabras condicionantes para forzar tu obediencia. Mientras el "
"mundo arde, tú tienes tu primer contacto con la vida."

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CBM Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero CBM"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CBM Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniera CBM"

#. ~ Profession (male CBM Engineer) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked as a technician in a sterile, high-security facility concerned "
"with the fabrication of bionic implants.  The final evacuation order caught "
"you in the middle of your 16 hour extended shift, and you barely managed to "
"escape the building, tools in hand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female CBM Engineer) description
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked as a technician in a sterile, high-security facility concerned "
"with the fabrication of bionic implants.  The final evacuation order caught "
"you in the middle of your 16 hour extended shift, and you barely managed to "
"escape the building, tools in hand."
