#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid "zombie voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "zombie voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "muñeco vudú zombi"
msgstr[1] "muñecos vudú zombi"
msgstr[2] "muñecos vudú zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie voodoo doll
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human, including pieces of bone "
"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr ""
"Es un efigie notablemente precisas de un humano muerto viviente, incluye "
"pedazos de hueso y órganos. La magia necromántica retrasa la putrefacción, "
"pero no dura para siempre. Pincharlo con una aguja puede forzarlo a que te "
"obedezca."

