"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr ""
"Es un efigie notablemente precisas de un puma muerto viviente, completado "
"con piel, huesos y órganos. La magia necromántica retrasa la putrefacción, "
