#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Warrior]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Warrior]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Through rigorous training, you've honed your body. Your endurance is "
"exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes increase stamina. Per level: "
"+0.55 STR, +0.2 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.15 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Berserker]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Berserker]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Rage fuels your strikes. Your fury makes you strike 15% faster. Your "
"endurance is exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes increase stamina."
" Per level: +0.75 STR, +0.45 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.2 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Guardian]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Guardian]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A living shield, protecting all. Your skin is naturally armored (+4 physical"
" armor). Your endurance is exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes "
"increase stamina. Per level: +0.6 STR, +0.15 DEX, +0.15 INT, +0.6 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mage]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Mage]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"The arcane flows through you naturally. Vast reserves of mana (+1000 mana, "
"+25% mana regen). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.05 DEX, +0.55 INT, +0.3 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mystic]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Mystic]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You channel raw destructive power. Your hands glow with light (15). Immense "
"reserves of mana (+2500 mana, +50% mana regen). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.2 "
"DEX, +0.75 INT, +0.45 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scholar]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Scholar]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge flows to you effortlessly. You read with supernatural "
"comprehension (+100% reading speed). Moderate mana reserves (+800 mana, +20%"
" mana regen). Per level: +0.05 STR, +0.15 DEX, +0.8 INT, +0.5 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Rogue]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Rogue]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Cunning and dexterous. A master of finesse and guile. Per level: +0.1 STR, "
"+0.55 DEX, +0.15 INT, +0.2 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scout]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Scout]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master tracker and observer. Your senses are razor sharp. Your movements are"
" unnaturally fast (5% faster movement, +1 speed per level). Per level: +0.15"
" STR, +0.3 DEX, +0.05 INT, +0.5 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Acrobat]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Acrobat]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A blur of graceful motion. Your reflexes are supernatural (+6 dodge bonus). "
"Your movements flow with impossible speed (8% faster movement, +1.5 speed "
"per level). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.8 DEX, +0.2 INT, +0.4 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Assassin]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Assassin]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A shadow striking without warning. You move in complete silence (-40% noise,"
" +30% hearing). You are nearly invisible (+50% stealth). Your movements blur"
" with supernatural speed (8% faster movement, +1.5 speed per level). Per "
"level: +0.1 STR, +0.75 DEX, +0.35 INT, +0.3 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Ranger]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Ranger]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master sharpshooter with perfect aim. You see clearly in darkness (night "
"vision 20 tiles). You require less water (half at level 10, none at 20). "
"Your movements are unnaturally fast (5% faster movement, +1 speed per "
"level). Per level: +0.15 STR, +0.45 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.8 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Craftsman]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Craftsman]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master of all trades. Your skilled hands work with incredible precision (+1 "
"to all crafting skills, +40% crafting speed). Per level: +0.2 STR, +0.3 DEX,"
" +0.4 INT, +0.6 PER"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Bionic Symbiote]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Bionic Symbiote]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your cells integrate seamlessly with cybernetics. Your body naturally "
"generates bionic power (regenerates 2 kJ per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Vital Essence]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Vital Essence]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Life energy flows through you. You are perpetually healthy and healing "
"(increases health by 0.02 per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Purifying Blood]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Purifying Blood]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your blood purifies toxins and radiation. You naturally cleanse radiation "
"from your body (removes 0.5 radiation per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Resistant Skin]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Resistant Skin]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is unnaturally resistant to environmental hazards. You naturally "
"resist corrosive and thermal damage (+4 acid armor, +4 heat armor)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Lightweight Frame]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Lightweight Frame]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body is optimized for speed over strength. You move much faster but "
"can't carry as much (25% faster movement, 25% less carry capacity)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Strong Back]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Strong Back]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You carry burdens that would crush others. Your carrying capacity is "
"significantly increased (+40% carry capacity)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Tireless]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Tireless]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your stamina seems endless. You can exert yourself for much longer (+50% max"
" stamina)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mana Font]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Mana Font]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Mana flows through you like a river. You possess increased magical power "
"(+1250 mana, +25% mana regen, +12.5% mana multiplier)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Blink Step]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Blink Step]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You move with supernatural quickness. Your movements are a blur (25% faster "
"movement)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Natural Healer]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Natural Healer]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body repairs itself rapidly. Your wounds close at an accelerated rate "
"(+50% HP regen while awake, +100% HP regen while resting)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Adaptive Biology]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Adaptive Biology]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body adapts to harsh conditions. You naturally resist extreme "
"temperatures (-750, 750 bodytemp units)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Glass Cannon]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Glass Cannon]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Immense power, fragile form. You move with tremendous speed (+20% speed) but"
" are more vulnerable (-2 physical armor)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Juggernaut]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Juggernaut]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"An unstoppable force. You are incredibly strong (+100% carry capacity, +8 "
"physical armor) but move very slowly (30% slower movement, 15% slower "
"speed)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Arcane Battery]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Arcane Battery]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You store immense magical energy. Your mana reserves are enormous (+5000 "
"mana) but regenerate very slowly (50% slower mana regen)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Iron Fists]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Iron Fists]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your fists are hardened weapons. Your unarmed strikes deal devastating "
"damage (+6 bash, +4 cut, +3 pierce damage)."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Efficient Metabolism]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Efficient Metabolism]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body uses resources efficiently. You need 40% less food and get tired "
"30% slower."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Combat Reflexes]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Combat Reflexes]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You react instantly to threats. Your reflexes grant superior evasion (+3 "
"dodge bonus)."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Acrobat]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You land gracefully from any height. You take 95% less falling damage and "
"gain +2 dodge bonus."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Tireless Worker]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Tireless Worker]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You never seem to tire. You get tired 50% slower and recover from fatigue "
"80% faster."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Rapid Metabolism]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Rapid Metabolism]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body processes energy rapidly. You regenerate stamina 100% faster but "
"need 40% more food."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scentless]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for [Scentless]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
