msgid "Your right foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "Tu pie derecho está como un bloque de hielo."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "Pierdes un poco el balance por tener el pie derecho helado."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "Sientes un martilleo en tu cabeza debido al calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "Estás transpirando como testigo falso."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "Tu mano izquierda está patinosa por la transpiración."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "Tu mano derecha está patinosa por la transpiración."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left leg is cramping up."
msgstr "Sientes un calambre en la pierna izquierda."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right leg is cramping up."
msgstr "Sientes un calambre en la pierna derecha."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your left foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "Sientes el pie izquierdo hinchado por el calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your right foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "Sientes el pie derecho hinchado por el calor."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "El calor te está haciendo ver cosas."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "Te cuesta agarrar cosas con los dedos dormidos."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "Se te durmió el pie."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "Sientes la cara adormecida."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your flesh crawls; insects tear through the flesh and begin to emerge!"
msgstr ""
"Tu carne está plagada de bichos. ¡Insectos desgarran tu piel y empiezan a "
"brotar!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Insects begin to emerge from <npcname>'s skin!"
msgstr "¡Insectos empiezan a brotar de la piel de <npcname>!"

#. ~ %s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You start scratching your %s!"
msgstr "¡Te rascas tu %s!"

#. ~ 1$s is NPC name, 2$s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s starts scratching their %2$s!"
msgstr "¡%1$s se está rascando su %2$s!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Why waste your time on that insignificant speck?"
msgstr "¿Para qué vas a gastar tiempo en esa mancha insignificante?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You feel something reaching out to you, before reality around you frays!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You pass out from the strain of something bearing down on your mind."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel something probing your mind, but it is rebuffed!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A terrifying image in the back out your mind paralyzes you."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel a buzzing in the back of your mind, but it passes."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel something scream in the back of your mind!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your vision is filled with bright lights…"
msgstr "Tu visión se llena de luces brillantes..."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A wave of nausea passes over you."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Shifting shapes dance on the edge of your vision."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You feel weird for a moment, but it passes."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "Te rodean luces brillantes, y te teletransportás."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You are beset with a vision of a prowling beast."
msgstr "Estás acosado con una visión de una bestia rondando."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "Your surroundings are permeated with a foul scent."
msgstr "Sus alrededores están impregnados de un olor desagradable."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "¡Aparece un monstruo cerca!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "¡Un portal se abre cerca, y un monstruo aparece arrastrándose!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "De repente, sientes un escalofrío."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You smell mold, and your skin itches."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "We have many colonists awaiting passage."
msgstr "Tenemos muchos colonos esperando un pasaje."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "A blue flash of radiation permeates your vision briefly!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "De repente, estás cubierto de ectoplasma."

